<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">- Vidunda Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Neh</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Vitabu vya Esila na Nehemiya vyangusimila ndaze wanhu wa isi ya Isilaeli vyowakundizwe kuhiluka kuli isi ya hewo ya Isilaeli vyowawele wekale kota wapogozi wa ngondo kuli isi za Pelisiya na Babuloni. Nehemiya kangulonga kuwala lukanzi luzungulute muji wa Yelusalemu vyouzenjigwa lwa keli. Wasomile wenji wa mbuli za Bibiliya wangukunda kota Esila nakavyandika vitabu vya 1 Mihela na 2 Mihela hamwe na vitabu vya Esila na Nehemiya na kuvikungajiza. Wone munhu yawele nakavyandika hawele Esila, koweza kuwa munhu yumwe yawele nakavikungajiza vitabu avi. Chitabu cha Nehemiya hanji nachikungajizwa kuli mwaka wa miya zine na makumi kadatu (430) Yesu yang'hali kupondigwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nehemiya ndo yawele nayali na mijito ja kumjidila divai mndewa Alitashasta. Nehemiya nakamlanda mndewa yamkundize yahiluche Yelusalemu leka yalute kutanza kuzenga ng'hanzi za muji wa Yelusalemu ziwele nazigwa. Alitashasta nakamkundiza Nehemiya kudita ahyo, hamba nakamhagula Nehemiya yawe chilongozi wa Yudeya, honhu hazungulute Yelusalemu (Nehemiya 5:14). Hanga wanhu wamwenga nawajeza kumlemeza Nehemiya kuzizenga ng'hanzi za Yelusalemu, kwa utanzi wa Nguluwi, mijito ajo najisinda kuli mhela wa mazuwa makumi gahano na meli (52). Hamba, Esila nakamtanza Nehemiya kuwalongoza Waisilaeli kudita kahi ilagano na Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1-6 zangusimila ndaze Nehemiya vyoyahiluche Yelusalemu na kulongoza mijito ja kuzenga kahi ng'hanzi za Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula ya 7-13 zangusimila ndaze Waisilaeli vyowaluche kikala Yelusalemu na kwaluka kahi kuwinza malajizo ga Nguluwi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1" />Awu ndo ulonzi wa Nehemiya, mwana wa Hakaliya.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="NEH 1:1">Kulanda kwa Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:1">Kuli mwezi wa Kisilevu mwaka wa makumi meli, mhela lombele kuli ngome, kuli ng'handa ya chiundewa ya Shushani, <verse eid="NEH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2" />Hanani, yumwe wa wang'holozangu, nakoya hamwe na wanhu wanji kulawa kuli isi ya Yuda, nandiwauza kuwala Wayahudi wayetu wasigale wawele hawalutile kuli isi ya chijenzi ako Babuloni na kuwala muji wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3" />Nawandonjela, “Wayahudi wawele hawalutile kuli isi ya chijenzi, wa kuli magazo na soni. Lukanzi lwa muji wa Yelusalemu nalubomoligwa na lwizi jake najilakazwa.”<verse eid="NEH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4" />Lonyhuliche mbuli azi, nandikalisa na kulila. Kwa mazuwa gamwenga nandali ndilombocheza na kwesela kulya na kulanda hali Nguluwi wa kilanga <verse eid="NEH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5" />ndilonga, “Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa kilanga, hegwe ndo Nguluwi uwele mng'hangala na ulingudumbiza, kwangibatilila ilagano lya hegwe na igano lya kwimilila kwa wala walingukugana na kibatilila malajizo ga hegwe. <verse eid="NEH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6" />Uhulichize kulanda kwa heni na undole heni chitumagwa wa hegwe, hondikulanda nechilo na nemisi kwa chiwalo cha vitumagwa wa hegwe, wanhu wa Isilaeli. Ndangulonga gehile ga hetwe wanhu wa Isilaeli, gotuditile hali hegwe, mbaka heni na ivyazi lya heni natudita gehile. <verse eid="NEH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7" />Natudita wihe hali hegwe, hatibatilile mizilo ja hegwe ne malajizo ga hegwe goumpele chitumagwa wa hegwe Musa.<verse eid="NEH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8" />“Ukumbuchile lelo gala goumlonjele chitumagwa wa hegwe Musa, vyoulonjile, ‘Wone hamuwa wa kukundigwa, ndowasambalula hali wanhu wa isi, <verse eid="NEH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9" />ila wone monyhulichiza na kibatilila mizilo ja heni na kujiwinza, hanga ndowa ndiwasambalule kutali ng'hatu, ndowahilula kuli honhu hondihahagule leka hawe haluga ha itagwa lya heni.’<verse eid="NEH 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10" />“Wanhu wa Isilaeli ndo vitumagwa wa hegwe na wanhu wa hegwe wawele nakuwagombola kwa mong'ho wa hegwe na kwa moko wa hegwe uwele na mong'ho. <verse eid="NEH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11" />Gwa Mkulu, uhulichize kulanda kwa heni chitumagwa wa hegwe na kulanda kwa vitumagwa wa hegwe walingusangalala kwa kukuhulichiza hegwe. Ndangukulanda undite ng'hundigwe na kulanda kwa heni kusumye hali mndewa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:11">Lelo, kuli mazuwa ago nandali na mijito ja kutawiza kota chilyo na divai vyahela dunga kwa chiwalo cha mndewa.<verse eid="NEH 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2" />
  <para style="s">Nehemiya kanguluta Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1" />Kuli mwezi wa Nisani mwaka wa makumi meli (20) wa ulongozi wa mndewa Alitashasta, mhela divai loigaligwe kwa heye, nandiihola divai ayo na kumha mndewa. Siwahiche kuwa na masinzo hali heye. <verse eid="NEH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2" />Lelo mndewa Alitashasta nakambuza, “Ndaze, lekachoni kumeho kwa hegwe kwangoneka kuna masinzo hanga haulingoneka kota kwa mtamwa? Mbuli ayi haiwele chinhu chinji, ila ndo masinzo ga mnhumbula.” Ahyo nandumba ng'hatu, <verse eid="NEH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3" />nandimwidichila mndewa, “Gwa mndewa, wikale mazuwa gose! Lekachoni ndeche kuwa na masinzo kuno muji wa Yelusalemu uwele na vilaga vya wasekulu wa heni nausigala mahame hela na lwizi jake najilakazwa?”<verse eid="NEH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4" />Mndewa Alitashasta nakambuza, “Lelo kwangulanda choni?” Nani nandimlanda Nguluwi wa kilanga, <verse eid="NEH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5" />hamba nandimwidichila mndewa, “Gwa mndewa, wone konojezwa na heni na wone namhata uganililo hali hegwe, ndangukulanda undajize ndute kuli isi ya Yuda leka ndikauzenje kahi muji wa Yelusalemu uwele na vilaga vya wasekulu wa hetwe.” <verse eid="NEH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6" />Hamba mndewa nakambuza kuno mchewake yawele habehi na heye, “Majendo ago gowa ga mhela wachi na kohiluka nili hano?” Mndewa nakakunda kulanda kwa heni, ahyo nandimlonjela mhela wa kuhiluka kwa heni. <verse eid="NEH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7" />Nandimlonjela kahi, “Gwa mndewa, wone konojezwa na heni, ndangulanda mhegwe baluwa leka ndizihiliche kwa vilongozi wa mkowa wa kolizinjilaga isanya mwa lwanda lwa Eyufulate leka wang'hundize kukola leka ndute kuli isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="NEH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8" />Ndangulanda kahi mhegwe baluwa leka nyhiliche kwa Asafu, yalingwamila chihulo cha chiundewa leka yamhe heni mbawo kwa chiwalo cha kugongomanya fulemu za lwizi ja ngome iwele habehi na ng'handa ya Nguluwi na lukanzi lwa muji na ng'handa ya heni iwele ndochikala amo.” Mndewa nakakunda kulanda kwa heni kwa vila Nguluwi nayali hamwe na heni.<verse eid="NEH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9" />Londiwafichile wakulu wa mkowa wa kolizinjilaga isanya mwa lwanda lwa Eyufulate, nandiwapa baluwa za mndewa. Mndewa nayali yandajize hamwe na vilongozi wa wamizi na wakwina falasi. <verse eid="NEH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10" />Ila Sanibalati, Mholoni na Tobiya, Mwamoni, lowahuliche kota nanduta leka kukola mijito jinojile kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa Isilaeli, nawazudila ng'hatu.<verse eid="NEH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nehemiya kangukagula ng'hanzi za Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11" />Nanduta ako Yelusalemu na kikala ako kwa mazuwa kadatu, <verse eid="NEH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12" />hamba nambuka nechilo hamwe na wanhu wachefu. Simlonjele munhu yoneche gala gawele Nguluwi nayali yagawichile mnhumbula mwa heni kwa chiwalo cha muji wa Yelusalemu. Nakwali na igongolo limwe hela, liwele nandali ng'winile. <verse eid="NEH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13" />Nandawa mgati nechilo ndikolela kuli Lwizi lwa Kibindi, kulutila kuli Ideho lya Izoka na kuli Lwizi lwa Mboto, nandizikagula ng'hanzi za muji wa Yelusalemu ziwele nazali zibomoligwe na lwizi jake jiwele najali jilakazwe. <verse eid="NEH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14" />Hamba, nanduta mbaka kuli lwizi lwa Nzasa na kuli Izimbo lya Mndewa. Ila hakuwele na honhu ha kuhega kwa chiwalo cha igongolo lya heni kukola, <verse eid="NEH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15" />ahyo nanduta kuli ibindi nechilo yila kuno ndikagula lukanzi. Hamba nanyhiluka na kwinjila kahi kwa kukolela Lwizi lwa Kibindi.<verse eid="NEH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16" />Vilongozi hawavizelele honhu hawele nanduta ne choni chonditile kwa vila nandali siwalonjele Wayahudi ne watambika ne vilongozi ne wang'hangala ne wala wanhu wawele wokola mijito ja kuuzenga kahi wula muji. <verse eid="NEH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17" />Hamba nandiwalonjela, “Mwangugona magazo gotuwele nago, muji wa Yelusalemu nausigala mahame na lwizi jake najilakazwa kwa chiluli. Lelo, muye tuzenje kahi lukanzi lwa Yelusalemu, natwe hatuweza kuwa kuli soni ayi.” <verse eid="NEH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18" />Nandiwalonjela ndaze Nguluwi vyoyawele hamwe na heni yonhanza kwa kunoga kwa heye. Nandiwalonjela kahi ulonzi uwele mndewa nayali yandonjele. Lowahuliche ago, nawalonga, “Goya, twaluche mijito ja kuzenga.” Ahyo nawaluka kiwika goya kwa mijito ajo jinojile. <verse eid="NEH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19" />Ila Sanibalati na Tobiya na Geshemu, Mwalabu, lowahuliche mbuli ayo, nawatuseka na kutubeza wolonga, “Ndo chinhu chachi achi chomlingudita? Ndaze, mwangugana kumbelenhuka mndewa?”<verse eid="NEH 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20" />Nandiwedichila kwa kulonga, “Nguluwi wa kilanga kotutanza kuli mijito aji, natwe tuwele ndo vitumagwa wa heye tokwaluka kuzenga. Ila hemwe mwahela honhu ne hachi ne kukumbuchila koneche kuli muji wa Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="NEH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3" />
  <para style="s">Matagwa ga wanhu wawele nawazenga kahi lukanzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1" />Eliashibu, mtambika mkulu, hamwe na watambika wayage nawaluta kukola mijito ja kuzenga kahi Lwizi lwa Ming'holo. Nawaludita lwizi alo luwe lwa chiuyeng'ha kwa Nguluwi na kuwika lwizi alo kuli honhu hake. Nawawika chiuyeng'ha kwaluchila kuli Ilingo lya Miya mbaka kuli Ilingo lya Hananeli. <verse eid="NEH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2" />Wanhu wa muji wa Yeliko nawazenga honhu hawele nahabakana na watambika, naye Sakuli, mwana wa Imuli, nakazenga honhu hayage ha lukanzi habehi na hewo.<verse eid="NEH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3" />Lwizi lwa Somba naluzenjigwa kahi na lukolo lwa Hasena, nawawika fulemu zake na lwizi na vibatilila lwizi na mhajilo zake. <verse eid="NEH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4" />Melemoti, mwana wa Uliya, mzukulu wa Hakosi, nakazenga kahi honhu hawinzile. Honhu hanji nahazenjigwa kahi na Meshulamu, mwana wa Belekiya, mzukulu wa Meshesabeli. Honhu hayage kahi nahazenjigwa kahi na Sadoki, mwana wa Baana. <verse eid="NEH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5" />Honhu hawinzile nahazenjigwa kahi na wanhu wawele nawalawa kuli muji wa Tekowa, ila vilongozi wa wanhu wa muji awo nawalema kukola mijito jowapegwe na vilongozi wa hewo.<verse eid="NEH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6" />Lwizi lwa Yeshana naluzenjigwa kahi na Yoyada, mwana wa Paseya hamwe na Meshulamu, mwana wa Besodeya. Nawawika fulemu zake na lwizi na vibatilila lwizi na mhajilo zake. <verse eid="NEH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7" />Wawinzile kuli mijito ajo ja kuzenga kahi nawali ndo Melatiya, Mgibeoni na Yadoni, Mmelonoti, hamwe na wanhu kulawa kuli miji ja Gibeoni na Misipa wawele nawali hali ulongozi wa chilongozi wa mkowa wa kolizinjilaga isanya mwa lwanda lwa Eyufulate. <verse eid="NEH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8" />Honhu hawinzile nahazenjigwa kahi na Usieli, mwana wa Halihaya, yumwe wa walinguponda zahabu, naye Hananiya, yumwe wa walingugongomanya unhunyhililo nakazenga honhu halinguwinza. Nawazenga kahi lukanzi lwa muji wa Yelusalemu mbaka kufika kuli Lukanzi Lugazi. <verse eid="NEH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9" />Honhu halinguwinza nahazenjigwa kahi na Lefaya, mwana wa Huli, mkulu wa nusu ya wilaya ya Yelusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10" />Honhu hawinzile halingilola na ng'handa ya heye nahazenjigwa kahi na Yedaya, mwana wa Halumafu. Honhu hawinzile kahi nahazenjigwa na Hatushi, mwana wa Hashabuneya. <verse eid="NEH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11" />Malikiya, mwana wa Halimu na Hashubu, mwana wa Pahati-moabu, nawazenga kahi honhu hawinzile kahi hamwe na Ilingo lya Mitanulu. <verse eid="NEH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12" />Honhu hawinzile nahazenjigwa kahi na Shalumu, mwana wa Haloheshi, chilongozi wa nusu iyage ya wilaya ya Yelusalemu. Nakazenga honhu aho kuno yotanzigwa na wahinza wa heye kuli kuzenga ako.<verse eid="NEH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13" />Lwizi lwa Kibindi naluzenjigwa kahi na Hanuni hamwe na wenyeng'haye wa muji wa Sanowa. Nawawika lwizi kuli honhu hake na vibatilila lwizi na mhajilo zake. Nawazenga kahi lukanzi luwele na ulefu wa mita miya zihano (500) mbaka kuli Lwizi lwa Mboto. <verse eid="NEH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14" />Lwizi lwa Mboto naluzenjigwa kahi na Malikiya, mwana wa Lekabu, chilongozi wa wilaya ya Beti-hakelemu. Nakawika lwizi kuli honhu hake na vibatilila lwizi na mhajilo zake.<verse eid="NEH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15" />Lwizi lwa Nzasa naluzenjigwa kahi na Shalumu, mwana wa Kolihose, chilongozi wa wilaya ya Misipa. Nakahagubika na kuwika lwizi kuli honhu hake na vibatilila lwizi na mhajilo zake. Nakazenga kahi lukanzi lwa Ilamba lya Shela luwele nalwali habehi na kagunda ka mndewa, mbaka kuli vikwinilo vilingudulika kulawa kuli muji wa mndewa Daudi. <verse eid="NEH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16" />Honhu hawinzile mbaka kuli vilaga vya chiundewa na ilamba na ng'handa za wamizi, nahazenjigwa kahi na Nehemiya, mwana wa Asibuki, chilongozi wa nusu ya wilaya ya Beti-suli.<verse eid="NEH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wawele nawazenga lukanzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17" />Hamba Walawi nawalutilila kuzenga kahi lukanzi. Honhu hawinzile nahazenjigwa kahi na Lehumu, mwana wa Bani. Yawinzile nayali Hashabiya, chilongozi wa nusu ya wilaya ya Keila. Ayu nakazenga honhu hamwenga kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa wilaya ya heye. <verse eid="NEH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18" />Hamba, kuzenga kahi nakukoleka na wang'holozawo, hali ulongozi wa Bavayi, mwana wa Henadadi, chilongozi wa nusu yinji ya wilaya ya Keila. <verse eid="NEH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19" />Honhu halinguwinza halingilola na ng'hano ya vinhu vya kitowela ngondo kuli nzingo ya lukanzi, nahazenjigwa kahi na Eseli, mwana wa Yeshuwa, chilongozi wa Misipa. <verse eid="NEH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20" />Honhu hawinzile mbaka kuli lwizi lwa Eliashibu, mtambika mkulu, nahazenjigwa kahi na Baluku, mwana wa Sakayi. <verse eid="NEH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21" />Honhu halinguwinza kwaluchila kuli lwizi lwa ng'handa ya Eliashibu, mtambika mkulu, mbaka kuli kuduma kwa ng'handa ayo, nahazenjigwa kahi na Melemoti, mwana wa Uliya, mzukulu wa Hakosi.<verse eid="NEH 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watambika wawele nawazenga lukanzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22" />Honhu hawinzile nahazenjigwa kahi na watambika wawele nawali wochikala kuli honhu halinguuzunguluta muji wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23" />Benjamini na Hashubu nawazenga kahi honhu hawele habehi na ng'handa za hewo. Asaliya, mwana wa Maaseya, mzukulu wa Ananiya, nakazenga kahi honhu hawele habehi na ng'handa ya heye. <verse eid="NEH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24" />Kwaluchila kuli ng'handa ya Asaliya mbaka kuli nzingo ya lukanzi, nahazenjigwa kahi na Binuyi, mwana wa Henadadi. <verse eid="NEH 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25" />Honhu hawinzile, kulawa kuli nzingo ya lukanzi mbaka kuli ilingo lya ng'handa ya mndewa ya mchanya habehi na honhu ha kwamila, nahazenjigwa kahi na Palali, mwana wa Usayi. Hamba, Pedaiya, mwana wa Paloshi <verse eid="NEH 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26" />na vitumagwa wa ng'handa ya Nguluwi wawele nawali wochikala mchanya mwa chidunda cha Ofeli, nawazenga kahi honhu ha habehi na Lwizi lwa Mazi na ilingo liwele ng'wemang'wema, kuli ubanzi wa kolilawilaga isanya.<verse eid="NEH 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walinguzenga wanji wawele nawakola mijito ja kuzenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27" />Honhu hanji hawinzile, kulawa kuli ilingo liwele ng'wemang'wema mbaka kuli lukanzi lwa Ofeli, nahazenjigwa kahi na wenyeng'haye wa muji wa Tekowa. <verse eid="NEH 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28" />Watambika nawazenga kahi mchanya mwa Lwizi lwa falasi, chila yumwe kumwando mwa ng'handa ya heye. <verse eid="NEH 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29" />Sadoki, mwana wa Imeli, nakazenga kahi honhu hawele kumwando mwa ng'handa ya heye. Honhu hawinzile nahazenjigwa kahi na Shemaya, mwana wa Shekaniya, mwamizi wa Lwizi lwa Kolilawilaga isanya. <verse eid="NEH 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30" />Hamba, Hananiya, mwana wa Shelemiya na Hanuni, mwana wa sita wa Salafu, nawazenga honhu hawinzile. Meshulamu, mwana wa Belekiya, nakazenga kahi honhu hawele habehi na chihengo cha heye. <verse eid="NEH 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31" />Honhu hawinzile, kulawa kuli ng'handa yowatumiye wakola mijito wa ng'handa ya Nguluwi na walinguguza na kugula vinhu, iwele nayali ichilola na Lwizi lwa Kukagula, habehi na chihengo cha kuchanya kuli nzingo, ubanzi wa kasikazini-kolilawilaga isanya, nahazenjigwa kahi na Malikiya, mponda zahabu.<verse eid="NEH 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32" />Honhu ha kuduma kulawa kuli chihengo cha kuli nzingo mbaka Lwizi lwa Ming'holo, nahazenjigwa kahi na walinguponda zahabu na walinguguza na kugula vinhu.<verse eid="NEH 3:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4" />
  <para style="s">Nehemiya kangukusumya kitwanza kuli mijito ja kuzenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1" />Sanibalati loyahuliche kota natwaluka mijito ja kuzenga kahi lukanzi, nakazudila ng'hatu. Nakaluka kuwabeza kwa kuwaseka Wayahudi <verse eid="NEH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2" />hali goloko wa heye na wamizi wa Wasamaliya, yolonga, “Wayahudi wano ng'hochele wangudita choni? Ndaze, wangunuwila kuuzenga kahi muji? Ndaze, wolavya nhambiko? Woweza kusinda mijito kwa zuwa limwe hela? Ndaze, woweza kugadita maganga gawichigwe kuli wavu na kulakazwa, gatanze kuli mijito ja kuzenjela?” <verse eid="NEH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3" />Tobiya, Mwamoni, yawele nayali yemile habehi na heye, nakalonga, “Wanguzenga choni? Wone ikanhu lyokwina mchanya mwa lukanzi alo lwa maganga, lyoweza kubomola!”<verse eid="NEH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4" />Heni Nehemiya, nandimlanda Nguluwi ndilonga, “Gwa Nguluwi wa hetwe, uhulichize vyowalingutubeza, uhiluse kubeza aku kwa hewo wawo na uwadite waholigwe leka wawe wapogozi kuli isi ya chijenzi. <verse eid="NEH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5" />Uleche kuilechela nongwa ya hewo ne gehile ga hewo kwa vila nawakuzudiza hali walinguzenga.”<verse eid="NEH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6" />Ila natulutilila kuzenga lukanzi mbaka nusu ya wimo wake kwa vila wanhu nawakola mijito kwa kunuwila kwa hewo wawo. <verse eid="NEH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7" />Ila Sanibalati na Tobiya na Waalabu na Waamoni na Waashidodi lowahuliche kota kuzenjigwa kahi kwa lukanzi lwa Yelusalemu kwangulutilila na kota honhu heng'ha hawele mwanzi kuli lukanzi nahazenjigwa goya, nawazudila ng'hatu. <verse eid="NEH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8" />Weng'ha nawewika goya kuya Yelusalemu kututowa na kwambuza kilewa kuli muji awo. <verse eid="NEH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9" />Ahyo natumlanda Nguluwi wa hetwe na kuwika wamizi chila honhu nechilo na nemisi, kwa chiwalo cha kiyamila kuwala hewo.<verse eid="NEH 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10" />Wanhu wa Yuda nawali wong'ung'uta wolonga, “Mong'ho wa wakola mijito wangupungula na wavu wa maganga ulinguganigwa kusigwa ung'hali winji. Hatuweza kulutilila kuzenga kahi lukanzi.” <verse eid="NEH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11" />Nawo wang'honyo wa hetwe nawali wolonga, “Hawoweza kuvizela ne kona mbaka hotufika kwa hewo na kuwakopola na kulemeza mijito.” <verse eid="NEH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12" />Hamba, Wayahudi wawele nawali wochikala hali wang'honyo wa hetwe lowahuliche mbuli ya hewo, nawoya kwa hetwe mzidi wa mala kumi wotulonjela, “Wokuya kulawa chila honhu howalingikala na kututowa.”<verse eid="NEH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13" />Ahyo, kuli honhu ha hasi ha ng'hanzi ziwele zing'hali kusinda kuzenjigwa na kumbele kwa ng'hanzi na kuli honhu hawele mwanzi, nandiwawika wanhu kwa kiwhana na ivyazi lya hewo, kuno wawele na mipanga na migoha na mipinde na misale. <verse eid="NEH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14" />Lombonile kota wanhu nawali na lunhwinhwi nandiwalonjela wakulu na vilongozi na wanhu weng'ha, “Mleche kuwadumba ne hado. Mkumbuchile Mkulu yawele ndo mng'hangala na wa kudumbiza, ahyo mitowe kwa chiwalo cha wang'holozenu na wasongolo wa hemwe na wahinza wa hemwe na wache wa hemwe na ivyazi lya hemwe.” <verse eid="NEH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15" />Wang'honyo lowahuliche kota natugazela majesa ga hewo gehile na kiwika goya kwa hewo na kota Nguluwi nakawifya majesa ga hewo, tweng'ha natuhiluka kuli lukanzi, chila yumwe kuli mijito ja heye.<verse eid="NEH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16" />Kulawa zuwa alyo na kulutilila, nusu ya vitumagwa wa heni nawali wolutilila na mijito ja kuzenga na nusu iyage nayali nawali wamizi wawele na migoha na ngawo na upinde na mivalo ja kwamila mhambaga. Vilongozi wa hetwe nawali ubanzi wa wanhu wa Yuda kwa chiwalo cha kuwatanza wala wawele nawali wokola mijito ja kuzenga lukanzi. <verse eid="NEH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17" />Wala wawele wopika vinhu vya kuzenjela nawalutilila na mijito aku moko umwe uwele na vinhu vya kuzenjela na moko uyage chinhu cha heye cha kitowela ngondo. <verse eid="NEH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18" />Chila yalinguzenga nayali na ipanga lya heye liwopigwe mchuno mwa heye aku yolutilila kuzenga. Munhu wa kupemba mhalamhanda nayali hamwe na heni. <verse eid="NEH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19" />Nandiwalonjela wakulu na vilongozi na wanhu weng'ha, “Mijito aji ndo jing'hang'hale na najenela hali honhu hakulu, natwe natusambaluka ng'hatu mchanya mwa lukanzi, chila yumwe ka kutali na myage. <verse eid="NEH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20" />Houwa honhu honeche ukola mijito, chila mhela louhulika mhalamhanda, ubilimile kwa hetwe. Nguluwi wa hetwe kotulewela.” <verse eid="NEH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21" />Ahyo, natulutilila kukola mijito ja hetwe. Nusu ya wanhu nawali webatilile vinhu vya kitowela ngondo kwaluchila mitondo mbaka nhondwe vyozoneche kilanga.<verse eid="NEH 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22" />Mhela awo kahi nandiwalonjela wanhu, “Chila munhu na mtanzi wa heye wekale mgati mwa muji wa Yelusalemu kuli mhela wa nechilo, leka tuwe na wanhu wa kutwamila kuli mhela wa nechilo na kulutilila na mijito kuli mhela wa nemisi.” <verse eid="NEH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23" />Ahyo, heni na wang'holozangu na vitumagwa wa heni na wamizi wawele nawali hamwe na heni, hatuvulile mivalo ja hetwe. Chila yumwe wa hetwe nayali na vinhu vya heye vya kitowela ngondo mmoko mwake chila mhela.<verse eid="NEH 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5" />
  <para style="s">Nehemiya kanguwatanza wazunwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1" />Loukolile mhela umwenga, nakulawila kung'ung'uta hali wanhu, walume na wache wa hewo wowang'ung'utila wang'holozawo Wayahudi. <verse eid="NEH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2" />Wamwe wa hewo nawali wolonga, “Hetwe na wasongolo wa hetwe na wahinza wa hetwe, ndo wenji. Ahyo, twangugana nyhule tulye leka tikale.” <verse eid="NEH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3" />Wanji nawalonga, “Natuwika lehani migunda ja hetwe na migunda ja hetwe ja mizabibu na ng'handa za hetwe leka tuwe na nyhule kwa chiwalo cha mhela wa lufemba.” <verse eid="NEH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4" />Nakwali na wanji kahi wawele nawali wolonga, “Naitugana kulanda kuwazichigwa sendi leka kulipa kodi ya mndewa kwa chiwalo cha migunda ja hetwe na migunda ja hetwe ja mizabibu. <verse eid="NEH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5" />Hetwe ndo kota Wayahudi wanji na wana wa hetwe ndo kota wana wa hewo. Twanguwadita wana wa hetwe wawe wapogozi kwa lupichi. Wahinza wa hetwe wamwenga nawawa wapogozi ila twahela ludali lwa kuwagombola kwa vila migunda ja hetwe na migunda ja mizabibu ja hetwe najiholigwa na wanji.”<verse eid="NEH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6" />Lonyhuliche kung'ung'uta ako, nanzudila ng'hatu. <verse eid="NEH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7" />Nandijesa kumutwi kwa heni, hamba nandiwalonjeleza wakulu na vilongozi, nandiwalonjela, “Mwanguwabunza wang'holozenu kwa kuwadita walipe liba.” Lelo, nandiwachema wanhu kuli nhing'hano kwa chiwalo cha mbuli ayo, <verse eid="NEH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8" />nandonga, “Natuwagombola kota vyotuwezile wang'holozetu Wayahudi wawele nawali waguzigwe kwa wanhu wa isi zinji. Ila sambi mwanguwadita wang'holozenu weguze wawo kwa hemwe!” Ahyo, nawenyamalila ne kwidichila.<verse eid="NEH 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9" />Hamba nandiwalonjela, “Chomlingudita ndo chiha ng'hatu. Ndaze, hamlinguganigwa kumdumba Nguluwi wa hetwe leka kuwalemeza wanhu wa isi zinji wawele ndo wang'honyo wa hetwe waleche kulonga vibi kuwala hetwe? <verse eid="NEH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10" />Heni na wang'holozangu na vitumagwa wa heni natwazika sendi na nyhule, ila hatulingugana kuhilusilwa na liba. <verse eid="NEH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11" />Lelo muwahilusile migunda ja hewo na migunda ja mizabibu na migunda ja mizeituni na ng'handa za hewo zomholile na kahi mhiluse chasi cha mzidi cha nyhule na divai na mafuta viwele namvihola kwa hewo.”<verse eid="NEH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12" />Nawedichila na kulonga, “Towahilusila na hatugana chinhu choneche mzidi kulawa kwa hewo. Todita kota vyoulonjile.” Hamba nandiwachema watambika na kuwadita vilongozi na wakulu welahe hali watambika kota wodita kota vyowalonjile. <verse eid="NEH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13" />Nandikung'huna nguwo ya heni na kulonga, “Chila yumwe yawele hokweneza chilaho achi, Nguluwi yamkung'hune kota ahi na yahole chila chinhu cha heye na yamlavye kuli ng'handa ya heye na kuli mijito ja heye. Yasukuligwe leka yawe yalihela chinhu na yasigale ne chinhu.” Nhing'hano yeng'ha nayidichila, “Ena,” na nawamtogola Mkulu Nguluwi. Wanhu nawadita kota vyowelahile.<verse eid="NEH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nehemiya kangulajila nhumbula ya isungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14" />Kulawa mhela uwele nandali nyhaguligwe kuwa chilongozi wa isi ya Yuda, kwa miyaka kumi na mili, jiwele ndo kulawa mwaka wa makumi meli (20) mbaka mwaka wa makumi gadatu na mili (32) wa ulongozi wa mndewa Alitashasta, sikundile kubochela sendi kwa chiwalo cha kugula chilyo chilinguganigwa kuligwa na chilongozi, mbaka wang'holozangu kahi nawadita hihyo du. <verse eid="NEH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15" />Vilongozi wawele nawandongola, nawali itunyo kwa wanhu wogana kupegwa chilyo na divai na kugana kupegwa sendi migwala makumi gane (40). Vitumagwa wa vilongozi awo nawo kahi nawawabunza wanhu. Ila, heni siditile ahyo kwa vila nandali ndimdumba Nguluwi. <verse eid="NEH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16" />Ila, nandikangaza ng'hatu kuli mijito ja kuzenga kahi kwa lukanzi alu. Wanhu wa heni weng'ha naweting'hana hala kwa chiwalo cha mijito ajo. Hatuholile mgunda woneche. <verse eid="NEH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17" />Mzidi wa ago, Wayahudi na vilongozi miya imwe na makumi gahano (150) nawalya hali chisaga cha heni, hamwe na wala wanhu wawele nawoya kwa hetwe kulawa kuli isi zinji za habehi. <verse eid="NEH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18" />Chila zuwa leka wanhu awa walye, nandavya sendi kwa chiwalo cha ibuguma na ming'holo sita jinojile na ng'huku kwa chiwalo cha kudumuligwa singo. Chila mazuwa kumi logakolile, nandavya vihako vya ngozi viwele na divai ilivinji. Ila siganile kupegwa chasi cha sendi, chiwele ndo hachi ya heni ya ulongozi, kwa vila wanhu nawali na itunyo likulu lukami.<verse eid="NEH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19" />Lelo, gwa Nguluwi wa heni, ukumbuchile isungu lya heni lyeng'ha lyondiwaditile wanhu awa.<verse eid="NEH 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6" />
  <para style="s">Majesa ga kumditila vibi Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1" />Sanibalati na Tobiya na Geshemu, Mwalabu na wang'honyo wa hetwe wanji, lowahuliche kota natusinda kuzenga kahi lukanzi na kota haduhu honhu hasigale kuzenjigwa, hanga mbaka mhela awo natwali hatuwichile lwizi hali honhu hake, <verse eid="NEH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2" />Sanibalati na Geshemu nawalajiza usenga kwa heni wolonga, “Uye, tuting'hane kuli chijiji chimwenga cha kuli isi ya ibalalika lya Ono.” Ila nawali wonuwila kunditila vibi. <verse eid="NEH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3" />Lelo, nani kahi nandiwalajiza wasenga kwa hewo, nandonga, “Mijito jondilingukola ndo mikulu lukami, ahyo siweza kuya kwa hemwe. Lekachoni ndechelele mijito leka mbuye kwa hemwe?”<verse eid="NEH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4" />Nawalutilila kulajiza usenga kwa heni mala zine, wogana ndute kwa hewo, ila nandiwedichila hihila. <verse eid="NEH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5" />Lelo, lwa kahano, Sanibalati nakamlajiza chitumagwa wa heye yangalile heni baluwa iwele haiwopigwe leka wanji waweze kusoma. <verse eid="NEH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6" />Baluwa ayo nayandichigwa hino, “Hana mbuli ziwele nazenela hali wanhu wa isi zinji za habehi, naye Geshemu kangutawiza mbuli azi, kota hegwe hamwe na Wayahudi wayago mwangunuwila kubelenhuka, ahyo acho ndo chiwalo cha hemwe kuzenga kahi lukanzi. Kwa kiwhana na mbuli azo, hegwe kwangunuwila kuwa mndewa wa hewo, <verse eid="NEH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7" />leka kutawiza majesa ga hegwe, nakiwichila waloli kuli muji wa Yelusalemu leka wawikule kota ‘Hana mndewa kuli isi ya Yuda.’ Mbuli ayi yohilikwa kwa mndewa Alitashasta. Ahyo, hegwe na heni tuting'hane na kulongasa kwa chiwalo cha mbuli ayi.”<verse eid="NEH 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8" />Nani nandimhilichila usenga awu, “Haduhu mbuli kota ayo. Mbuli azo zangulawa kumutwi kwa hegwe hela.” <verse eid="NEH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9" />Wang'honyo wa hetwe nawali wogana kutudita tuwe na lunhwinhwi leka tulechelele mijito. Ila nandimlanda Nguluwi leka yamhe heni mong'ho.<verse eid="NEH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10" />Zuwa limwe londutile kaye kwa Shemaya, mwana wa Delaya, mwana wa Mehetabeli, yawele nayali yalemezwe kulawa kaye kwa heye, nakandonjela, “Tulute kiting'hana kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi na kuhinda lwizi jake, kwa vila lehano nechilo wanhu wanguya kukukopola.” <verse eid="NEH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11" />Ila heni nandimwidichila, “Ndaze, munhu kota heni kanguganigwa kubilima? Ama munhu kota heni kanguganigwa kwinjila kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi leka yalohole ukomu wa heye? Hambe nyinjile kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi.” <verse eid="NEH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12" />Nandivizela kota nayali halajizwe na Nguluwi, ila nakapegwa sendi na Tobiya na Sanibalati leka yawikule mbuli zihile kuwala heni. <verse eid="NEH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13" />Nayali yapegwe sendi leka kundita ndumbe, ahyo ndite gehile, hamba waweze kuliwifya itagwa lya heni na kumbasa soni.<verse eid="NEH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14" />Nandimlanda Nguluwi ndilonga, “Gwa Nguluwi, ukumbuchile geng'ha gowaditile Tobiya na Sanibalati, mbaka yula mloli mdala yalinguchemigwa Noadiya na waloli wanji wawele nawali wogana kundita ndumbe.”<verse eid="NEH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusinda mijito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15" />Lelo, mijito ja kuzenga kahi lukanzi najisinda kuli zuwa lya makumi meli na gahano lya mwezi wa Eluli, mijito aji najikoleka kwa mhela wa mazuwa makumi gahano na meli (52). <verse eid="NEH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16" />Wang'honyo wa hetwe wa kuli isi za habehi, lowahuliche kota natusinda mijito, nawadumba na kona soni ng'hatu, kwa vila nawavizela kota mijito aji natusinda kwa kutanzigwa na Nguluwi wa hetwe.<verse eid="NEH 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17" />Mhela awo weng'ha, vilongozi wa Wayahudi nawali womwandichila Tobiya baluwa nyinji, naye Tobiya nayali yolutilila kuwedichila. <verse eid="NEH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18" />Wanhu wenji kuli Wayahudi nawelaha kilumba na Tobiya, kwa vila Tobiya nayali mkweye Shekaniya, mwana wa Ala. Mzidi wa ago Yehohanani, mwana wa Tobiya, nayali yamhesile mhinza wa Meshulamu, mwana wa Belekiya. <verse eid="NEH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19" />Kahi nawasimila heni madito ganojile ga Tobiya na mbuli za heni nawali womhilichila Tobiya. Naye Tobiya nayali yonyandichila baluwa za kundumbiza.<verse eid="NEH 6:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1" />Mijito ja kuzenga kahi lukanzi lojisindile na lwizi jeng'ha kuwichigwa kuli honhu hake na kahi kuhaguligwa kwa wamizi wa lwizi na walingwimba na Walawi, <verse eid="NEH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2" />nandimhagula mng'holozangu yalinguchemigwa Hanani leka yawe chilongozi wa kuli muji wa Yelusalemu, yokola mijito na Hananiya, yawele nayali chilongozi wa ngome kuli muji wa Yelusalemu, kwa vila nayali wa kukundigwa na yalingumdumba Nguluwi ng'hatu kusinda wanhu wanji. <verse eid="NEH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3" />Nandiwalajiza, “Lwizi jileche kuchumuligwa nechilo yeng'ha mbaka isanya holiwa kuchanya. Wamizi lowowa wang'hali kuka yanguganigwa kuhinda lwizi jeng'ha kwa mhajilo. Muwahagule wamizi wamwenga hali wenyeng'haye wa muji wa Yelusalemu kwamila lukanzi, wanji wawe hali honhu ha habehi na ng'handa za hewo.”<verse eid="NEH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wawele nawahiluka kulawa kuli isi ya chijenzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EZR 2:1-70">Esila 2:1-70</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4" />Muji wa Yelusalemu nawali ugazi na ukulu, ila wanhu wake nawali wachefu na ng'handa nazali mahame hela. <verse eid="NEH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5" />Ahyo Nguluwi nakamha heni mong'ho wa kuwakungajiza wang'hangala na vilongozi na wanhu wanji leka kuzizela ng'holo za hewo. Namhata chitabu chiwele nachandichigwa kuwala ng'holo za wanhu wawele nawali wa mwaluko kuhiluka kulawa kuli isi ya chijenzi. Walinguwinza ndo wanhu wawele nawandichigwa mgati mwa chitabu acho.<verse eid="NEH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6" />Wano ndo wanhu wa mkowa wawele nawalawa kuli isi ya chijenzi, wawele Nebukadinesa, mndewa wa Babuloni, nayali yawahiliche kwa lupichi ako Babuloni, nawahiluka Yelusalemu na Yuda chila yumwe kuli muji wa heye. <verse eid="NEH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7" />Vilongozi wa hewo nawali Selubabeli na Yeshuwa na Nehemiya na Asaliya na Laamiya na Nahamani na Molidekayi na Bilishani na Misipeleti na Bigwayi na Nehumu na Baana. Ilinguya ndo hisabu ya wanhu weng'ha wa ng'holo za Isilaeli wawele nawahiluka kulawila kuli isi ya chijenzi. <verse eid="NEH 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8" />Kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Paloshi, nawali elufu mbili na miya imwe na makumi saba na weli (2,172), <verse eid="NEH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Shefatiya, nawali miya zidatu na makumi saba na weli (372), <verse eid="NEH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Ala, nawali miya sita na makumi gahano na weli (652), <verse eid="NEH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Pahati-moabu, wawele nawali ndo walelwa wa Yeshuwa na Yoabu, nawali elufu mbili na miya nane na kumi na nane (2,818), <verse eid="NEH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Elamu, nawali elufu imwe na miya mbili na makumi gahano na wane (1,254), <verse eid="NEH 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Satu, nawali miya nane na makumi gane na wahano (845), <verse eid="NEH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Sakayi, nawali miya saba na makumi sita (760), <verse eid="NEH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Binuyi, nawali miya sita na makumi gane na nane (648), <verse eid="NEH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Bebayi, nawali miya sita na makumi meli na nane (628), <verse eid="NEH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Asigadi, nawali elufu mbili na miya zidatu na makumi meli na weli (2,322), <verse eid="NEH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Adonikamu, nawali miya sita na makumi sita na saba (667), <verse eid="NEH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Bigwayi, nawali elufu mbili na makumi sita na saba (2,067), <verse eid="NEH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Adini, nawali miya sita na makumi gahano na wahano (655), <verse eid="NEH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Ateli, yawele nakalawa kuli ivyazi lya Hesekiya, nawali makumi tisa na wanane (98), <verse eid="NEH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Hashumu, nawali miya zidatu na makumi meli na wanane (328), <verse eid="NEH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Besayi, nawali miya zidatu na makumi meli na wane (324), <verse eid="NEH 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Halifu, nawali miya imwe na kumi na weli (112), <verse eid="NEH 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Gibeoni, nawali makumi tisa na wahano (95).<verse eid="NEH 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26" />Wanhu wa miji jilinguwinza nawo nawahiluka, wanhu wa muji wa Betelehemu na Netofahi, nawali miya imwe na makumi nane na nane (188), <verse eid="NEH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27" />kulawa kuli muji wa Anatoti, nawali miya imwe na makumi meli na nane (128), <verse eid="NEH 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28" />kulawa kuli muji wa Beti-asimaweti, nawali makumi gane na weli (42), <verse eid="NEH 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29" />kulawa kuli miji ja Kiliati-yealimu na Kefila na Beeloti, nawali miya saba na makumi gane na wadatu (743), <verse eid="NEH 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30" />kulawa kuli miji ja Lama na Geba, nawali miya sita na makumi meli na yumwe (621), <verse eid="NEH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31" />kulawa kuli muji wa Mikimashi, nawali miya imwe na makumi meli na weli (122), <verse eid="NEH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32" />kulawa kuli miji ja Beteli na Ayi, nawali miya imwe na makumi meli na wadatu (123), <verse eid="NEH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33" />kulawa kuli muji wa Nebo, nawali makumi gahano na weli (52), <verse eid="NEH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34" />kulawa kuli muji wa Elamu yinji, nawali elufu imwe na miya mbili na makumi gahano na wane (1,254), <verse eid="NEH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35" />kulawa kuli muji wa Halimu, nawali miya zidatu na makumi meli (320), <verse eid="NEH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36" />kulawa kuli muji wa Yeliko, nawali miya zidatu na makumi gane na wahano (345), <verse eid="NEH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37" />kulawa kuli miji ja Lodi na Hadidi na Ono, nawali miya saba na makumi meli na yumwe (721), <verse eid="NEH 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38" />kulawa kuli muji wa Senaa, nawali elufu zidatu na miya tisa na makumi gadatu (3,930).<verse eid="NEH 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39" />Ayi ndo hisabu ya watambika wawele nawahiluka kulawa kuli isi ya chijenzi. Kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Yedaya, wawele nawali ndo walelwa wa Yeshuwa, nawali miya tisa na makumi saba na wadatu (973), <verse eid="NEH 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40" />kulawa kuli lukolo wa Imeli, nawali elufu imwe na makumi gahano na weli (1,052), <verse eid="NEH 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Pashuli, nawali elufu imwe na miya mbili na makumi gane na saba (1,247), <verse eid="NEH 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42" />kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Halimu, nawali elufu imwe na kumi na saba (1,017).<verse eid="NEH 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43" />Walawi wa lukolo lwa Yeshuwa, yawele ndo Kadimieli, walelwa wa Hodaviya wawele nawahiluka kulawa kuli isi ya chijenzi, nawali makumi saba na wane (74). <verse eid="NEH 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44" />Walingwimba, wawele ndo walelwa wa Asafu, nawali miya imwe na makumi gane na wanane (148). <verse eid="NEH 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45" />Wamizi wa lwizi lwa ng'handa ya Nguluwi, wawele ndo walelwa wa Shalumu na wa Ateli na wa Talimoni na wa Akubu na wa Hatita na wa Shobayi, nawali miya imwe na makumi gadatu na wanane (138).<verse eid="NEH 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46" />Vitumagwa wa ng'handa ya Nguluwi wawele nawahiluka kulawa kuli isi ya chijenzi, nawalawa kuli lulelo lwa Siha na lwa Hasufa na lwa Tabaoti <verse eid="NEH 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47" />na lwa Kelosi na lwa Siya na lwa Padoni <verse eid="NEH 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48" />na lwa Lebana na lwa Hagaba na lwa Shamulayi <verse eid="NEH 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49" />na lwa Hanani na lwa Gideli na lwa Gahali <verse eid="NEH 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50" />na lwa Leaya na lwa Lesini na lwa Nekoda <verse eid="NEH 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51" />na lwa Gasamu na lwa Usa na lwa Paseya <verse eid="NEH 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52" />na lwa Besayi na lwa Meunimu na lwa Nefushesimu <verse eid="NEH 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53" />na lwa Bakibuki na lwa Hakufa na lwa Halihuli <verse eid="NEH 7:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54" />na lwa Basiliti na lwa Mehida na lwa Halisha <verse eid="NEH 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55" />na lwa Balikosi na lwa Sisela na lwa Tema <verse eid="NEH 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56" />na lwa Nesiya na lwa Hatifa.<verse eid="NEH 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57" />Walelwa wa vitumagwa wa mndewa Solomoni wawele nawahiluka kulawa kuli isi ya chijenzi, nawalawa kuli lulelo lwa Sotayi na lwa Sofeleti na lwa Pelida <verse eid="NEH 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58" />na lwa Yaala na lwa Dalikoni na lwa Gideli <verse eid="NEH 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59" />na lwa Shefatiya na lwa Hatili na lwa Pokeleti-hasebaimu na lwa Amoni.<verse eid="NEH 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60" />Lelo vitumagwa weng'ha wa ng'handa ya Nguluwi na walelwa wa vitumagwa wa Solomoni, wawele nawahiluka kulawa kuli isi ya chijenzi, nawali miya zidatu na makumi tisa na weli (392). <verse eid="NEH 7:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61" />Wanhu wa miji ja Teli-mela na Teli-halisha na Kelubu na Adoni na Imeli, nawo nawahiluka ila hawawezile kutawiza kota nawali walelwa wa Waisilaeli. <verse eid="NEH 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62" />Hewo nawali walelwa wa Delaya na wa Tobiya na wa Nekoda, ahyo hisabu ya hewo weng'ha, nawali miya sita na makumi gane na weli (642).<verse eid="NEH 7:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63" />Wanhu wa ng'holo za watambika kahi nawahiluka. Wanhu awo nawali kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Habaya na lwa Hakosi na lwa Balisilayi. Ayo Balisilayi nayali yamhesile mhinza wa Balisilayi wa Gileadi, ahyo nakamula kuhola itagwa lilyo, Balisilayi. <verse eid="NEH 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64" />Awo nawapala hisabu ya hewo kuli kukumbuchila kwa vitabu vya ng'holo, ila hawoneche amo. Lelo hawakundizwe kuuhola utambika kwa vila nawoneka ndo wakokomoche. <verse eid="NEH 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65" />Chilongozi wa mkowa nakawalonjela kota hawalingukundigwa kihanza kuli chilyo chelile ng'hatu, mbaka yawe baho mtambika yawele yoweza kulavya ulonzi kulawa kwa Nguluwi kwa kutumiya maganga ga Ulimu na Sumimu.<verse eid="NEH 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66" />Wanhu weng'ha wawele nawahiluka kulawa kuli isi ya chijenzi, hisabu ya hewo nayali elufu makumi gane na mbili na miya zidatu na makumi sita (42,360). <verse eid="NEH 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67" />Nakwali na vitumagwa walume na wadala elufu saba na miya zidatu na makumi gadatu na saba (7,337) na walingwimba walume na wadala, weng'ha nawali miya mbili na makumi gane na wahano (245). <verse eid="NEH 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68" />Nawali na falasi miya saba na makumi gadatu na sita (736) na migongolo kota midogowi mikulu miya mbili na makumi gane na jihano (245) <verse eid="NEH 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69" />na ngamiya miya zine na makumi gadatu na wahano (435) na midogowi elufu sita na miya saba na makumi meli (6,720).<verse eid="NEH 7:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70" />Vilongozi wamwenga wa ivyazi nawatanza mijito ja kuzenga kahi ng'handa ya Nguluwi. Chilongozi wa mkowa nakalavya kilo nane za zahabu na visaye makumi gahano (50) na mivalo ja watambika miya zihano na makumi gadatu (530). <verse eid="NEH 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71" />Wakulu wanji wa ivyazi nawalavya kilo miya imwe na makumi gahano na zidatu (153) za zahabu na kilo elufu imwe na miya zine na makumi sita (1,460) za sendi. <verse eid="NEH 7:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72" />Ndolendole za wanhu wanji weng'ha, nazali kilo miya imwe na makumi gahano na zidatu (153) za zahabu na kilo elufu imwe na miya zidatu na makumi gadatu (1,330) za sendi na mivalo ja watambika makumi sita na saba (67).<verse eid="NEH 7:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73" />Lelo, watambika na Walawi na wamizi wa lwizi lwa ng'handa ya Nguluwi na walingwimba na vitumagwa wa ng'handa ya Nguluwi, hamwe na wanhu wanji wamwenga na Waisilaeli wasigale, nawekala kuli miji jawo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:73">Loufichile mwezi wa saba, Waisilaeli nawali kuli miji jawo.<verse eid="NEH 7:73" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8" />
  <para style="s">Esila kanguwasomela wanhu malajizo gawele Nguluwi nakamha Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1" />Wanhu weng'ha kwa kunuwila kumwe, nawekungajiza mujini Yelusalemu kuli luga luwele habehi na lwizi lwa muji ulinguchemigwa Lwizi lwa Mazi. Nawamlonjela Esila, yalingwandika, yachigale chitabu cha malajizo ga Musa, chiwele Mkulu Nguluwi nakawapa wanhu wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="NEH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2" />Lelo, kuli zuwa lya mwaluko lya mwezi wa saba, mtambika Esila nakegala malajizo hali nhing'hano, kuwele nakwali na walume na wadala. <verse eid="NEH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3" />Nakasoma kwa lizi likulu kulawa lokubwemwenzuche mbaka nemisi, yawele yemile yolola kulutila kuli luga luwele kumwando mwa Lwizi lwa Mazi hali walume na wadala. Wanhu weng'ha nawauhulichiza goya ulonzi uwele nawandichigwa kuli chila chitabu cha malajizo.<verse eid="NEH 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4" />Esila, yalingwandika, nayali yemile mchanya mwa ilingo lya migodi liwele nalizenjigwa kwa chiwalo acho. Habehi na heye kuli ubanzi wa heye wa kudilo nawali wemile Matitiya na Shema na Anaya na Uliya na Hilikiya na Maaseya. Kuli ubanzi wa heye wa kumoso nakwali na Pedaya na Mishaeli na Malikiya na Hashumu na Hashibadani na Sekaliya na Meshulamu.<verse eid="NEH 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5" />Esila nakachigubula chila chitabu, wanhu weng'ha nawaweza kumona kwa vila nayali yemile kuchanya ng'hatu. Loyachigubule chila chitabu, wanhu weng'ha nawema. <verse eid="NEH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6" />Esila nakamtogola Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi mkulu na wanhu weng'ha nawenula moko ga hewo na kwidichila, “Ena! Ena!” Hamba nawamfugamila Mkulu Nguluwi kuno kumeho kwa hewo nakwali kudoliza misanga.<verse eid="NEH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7" />Walawi wamwenga nawatanza kuwalangusa wanhu malajizo. Walawi awo ndo Yeshuwa na Bani na Shelebiya na Yamini na Akubu na Shabetayi na Hodiya na Maaseya na Kelita na Asaliya na Yosabadi na Hanani na Pelaya. Nawadita ahyo chila yumwe yawele yemile hali honhu ha heye. <verse eid="NEH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8" />Nawasoma kulawa kuli chila chitabu cha malajizo ga Nguluwi, wotang'hula na kuwazelesa wanhu leka wavizele goya chila chiwele nachali chisomigwa. <verse eid="NEH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9" />Wanhu lowagahuliche malajizo nawona usungu ng'hatu, ahyo weng'ha nawaluka kulila. Nehemiya yawele nayali chilongozi na Esila, mtambika na yalingwandika, hamwe na Walawi wawele nawali wowalangusa wanhu, nawawalonjela wanhu weng'ha, “Zuwa ali ndo lyelile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe, ahyo mleche kulombocheza ne kulila. <verse eid="NEH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10" />Mlute haluga ha hemwe na msangalale kwa kulya chilyo chinojile na kunwa divai inojile na mkumbuchile kuhilika honhu ha vinhu avyo kwa wala walihela, kwa vila zuwa ali ndo lyelile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi wa hetwe. Mleche kuwa na masinzo kwa vila kusangalala kompegwe na Mkulu Nguluwi kowapa hemwe mong'ho.”<verse eid="NEH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11" />Ahyo, Walawi nawawadita wanhu weng'ha wasindamale, wolonga, “Msindamale, kwa vila ali ndo zuwa lyelile. Mleche kuwa na masinzo.” <verse eid="NEH 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12" />Wanhu weng'ha nawaluta haluga ha hewo leka kulya na kunwa kuno wosangalala na kuwagawila wanji chilyo kwa vila nawauzela ulonzi weng'ha uwele nauwikuligwa kwa hewo.<verse eid="NEH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13" />Zuwa liwinzile, vilongozi wa ng'holo zeng'ha hamwe na watambika na Walawi, naweting'hana kwa Esila, yalingwandika, leka kilangusa malajizo. <verse eid="NEH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14" />Nawavizela kota nayandichigwa kuli chitabu cha malajizo kota Mkulu Nguluwi nakalajiza kwa kukolela Musa, kota Waisilaeli nawaganigwa kikala kuli vibumuli kuli mhela wa mnvina ya mwezi wa saba. <verse eid="NEH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15" />Kahi nawaganigwa kuuwikula ulonzi awo na kuweneza kuli miji ja hewo na kuli Yelusalemu wolonga, “Mlute kuli isi ya vidunda na kigala nhagala za mizeituni na mizeituni ja kisolo na mihadasi na michikichi na migodi ja lubehelo, leka kugongomanya vibumuli, kota vyoyandichigwe.”<verse eid="NEH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16" />Lelo, wanhu nawaluta kuhola na kigala nhagala na kizenjela vibumuli mchanya mwa vinduwiko vya ng'handa za hewo na kuli lugagala lwa ng'handa za hewo na kuli lugagala lwa ng'handa ya Nguluwi na kuli luga lwa habehi na Lwizi lwa Mazi na luga lwa Lwizi lwa Efulaimu. <verse eid="NEH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17" />Wanhu weng'ha wawele nawahiluka kulawa kuli isi ya chijenzi, nawazenga vibumuli na kikala mgati mwake. Kulawa mhela wa Yoshua, mwana wa Nuni mbaka zuwa lila, Waisilaeli hawawahiche kudita mnvina kota ayo. Kusangalala kwa hewo nakwali kukulu ng'hatu. <verse eid="NEH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18" />Chila zuwa, kwaluchila zuwa lya mwaluko mbaka zuwa lya kuduma, Esila nakawasomela wanhu chitabu cha malajizo ga Nguluwi. Nawadita mnvina ayo kwa mhela wa mazuwa saba, kuli zuwa lya nane nawadita nhing'hano ng'hulu ya kusinda kwa mnvina, kota vyoilajizwe.<verse eid="NEH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wangulonga gehile ga hewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1" />Kuli zuwa lya makumi meli na zine (24) lya mwezi wuwo wa saba, wanhu wa Isilaeli nawekungajiza, wokwesela kulya na kuvala mivalo ja migunila na kibakaliza nhimbwisi kumutwi kulajila masinzo. <verse eid="NEH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2" />Mhela awo, walelwa wa Isilaeli nawali webagule kutali na wanhu wa isi zinji, nawema hali honhu hamwenga na kulonga gehile ga hewo na wihe wa wasekulu wa hewo kwa chiwalo cha kumgalamchila Nguluwi. <verse eid="NEH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3" />Kwa mhela wa kota saa zidatu nawema kuno malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hewo nagali gosomigwa na kwa mhela wa saa zidatu ziyage nawali wolonga gehile ga hewo na kumfugamila Nguluwi wa hewo.<verse eid="NEH 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4" />Nakwali na Walawi wamwenga wawele nawali mchanya mwa ilingo lya Walawi. Walawi awo ndo Yeshuwa na Bani na Kadimieli na Shebaniya na Buni na Shelebiya na Bani na Kenani. Awo nawamlanda Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hewo, kwa lizi likulu. <verse eid="NEH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5" />Nawo Walawi, wawele ndo Yeshuwa na Kadimieli na Bani na Hashabuneya na Shelebiya na Hodiya na Shebaniya na Petahiya, nawawalonjela wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">“Mwime na kumtogola Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">Mumtogole mazuwa gose!”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 9:5">Hamba yumwe wa Walawi nakalutilila kumlanda Nguluwi yolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">“Wanhu walitogole itagwa lya hegwe likulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">liwele lyangutogoligwa kusinda utambichizo na lutogo lweng'ha.<verse eid="NEH 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6" />Hegwe uliyeka ndo Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">Hegwe ndo nakulumba ulanga na wamizi weng'ha wa ako kilanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">isi na vyeng'ha viwele mgati mwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">bahali na vyeng'ha viwele mgati mwake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">Hegwe nakuvidita vinhu vyeng'ha viwe vikomu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">na wamizi wa kilanga wangukufugamila.<verse eid="NEH 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7" />Hegwe ndo Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi uwele nakumhagula Abulamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:7">nakumlavya kulawa Uli ya Wakalidayo na kumha itagwa, Abulahamu.<verse eid="NEH 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8" />Nakumona kota nakatanganika hali hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">nakudita ilagano na heye kota kowapa walelwa wa heye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">isi ya Wakanaani na Wahiti na Waamoli na Wapelisi na Wayebusi na Wagiligashi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">Nakweneza kulagana kwa hegwe kwa vila ndo uwele na hachi.<verse eid="NEH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9" />“Nakugona magazo ga wasekulu wa hetwe lowawele kuli isi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:9">lowalandile utanzi wa hegwe kuli bahali ya Shamu, nakuwedichila.<verse eid="NEH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10" />Nakudita ulajilo na vinduzanduza kwa Falao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">na kwa vilongozi wa heye weng'ha na wanhu weng'ha wa isi ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">kwa vila nakuvizela ndaze Wamisili vyowawaditile vibi wasekulu wa hetwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">Nakiditila itagwa lilingikala mbaka lehano.<verse eid="NEH 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11" />Nakuigawanula bahali hagati hali hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">leka wakole hagati hake hawele hali honhu hakalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">ila nakuwatoza Wamisili wawawinzile mgati mwa mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">kota iganga likulu mgati mwa mazi menji.<verse eid="NEH 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12" />Nemisi nakuwalongoza kwa izengo lya ng'hungugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:12">nechilo nakuwalongoza kwa izengo lya chiluli, leka kuwalajila nzila.<verse eid="NEH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13" />“Nakudulika kuli chidunda cha Sinai, nakulongasa na hewo kulawa kilanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:13">Nakuwapa malajizo na mizilo ja kukomya na ja hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:13">malajizo na mizilo jinojile.<verse eid="NEH 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14" />Nakuwazelesa zuwa lya hegwe lyelile lya kwesela na kuwapa mizilo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:14">na malajizo kwa kukolela chitumagwa wa hegwe Musa.<verse eid="NEH 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15" />Kuli nzala nakuwapa chilyo kulawa kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">kuli ng'halu nakuwapa mazi kulawa kuli italawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">Nakuwalonjela wenjile na kuihola isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">iwele nawali nakilaha kota kowapa.<verse eid="NEH 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16" />“Ila wasekulu wa hetwe, nawali wajuvi na nhumbula zigagadale</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:16">nawalema kuwinza malajizo ga hegwe.<verse eid="NEH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17" />Nawalema kuhulichiza, hawakumbuchile vinduzanduza vyouditile hali hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">Nawali na nhumbula zigagadale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">na kuli kubelenhuka kwa hewo nawehagulila chilongozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">leka wahiluche kuli upogozi wa hewo kuli isi ya Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">Ila hegwe ndo Nguluwi ulingulechela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">uwele na kunoga na isungu ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">haulinguzudila himahima na kuna igano lya kwimilila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">Ahyo, huwalechile,<verse eid="NEH 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18" />hanga nawegongomanyila limalukolo lya ilogota na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:18">‘Ayu ndo mlungu wa hetwe, yawele nakatulavya kulawa kuli isi ya Misili.’<verse eid="NEH 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19" />“Kwa chiwalo cha winji wa isungu lya hegwe, huwalechile kula kuchiwala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:19">Mhela wa nemisi lila izengo lya ng'hungugu halilechile kuwalongoza kuli nzila ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:19">ne izengo lya chiluli halilechile kuwalangazila nechilo nzila yowaganigwe kuluta.<verse eid="NEH 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20" />Nakuwapa muhe wa hegwe yanojile leka yawalanguse.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:20">Hulechile kuwapa mana iwe chilyo kuli milomo ja hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:20">na mazi kwa chiwalo cha ng'halu ya hewo.<verse eid="NEH 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21" />Nakuwalolela kuchiwala kwa miyaka makumi gane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:21">Hawesilwe choneche na mivalo ja hewo hajilalile ne magulu ga hewo hagatunile.<verse eid="NEH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22" />“Nakuwadita wawasumye wandewa na wanhu wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:22">na kuzihola isi za hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:22">Nawaisumya isi ya Heshiboni koyawele yolongoza mndewa Sihoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:22">na isi ya Bashani koyawele yolongoza mndewa Ogu.<verse eid="NEH 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23" />Nakuwadita wana wa hewo wawe wenji kota nhondwe za kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:23">nakuwegala kuli isi iwele nakulagana na wasekulu wa hewo kota wokwinjila na kuihola.<verse eid="NEH 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24" />Ahyo, walelwa wa hewo nawaisumya isi ya Kanaani na kuihola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">Nakuwatanza kuwasumya wandewa na wanhu wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">na kuwaditila wang'honyo wa hewo kota vyowalingugana.<verse eid="NEH 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25" />Nawajihola miji jiwele na ngome na isi iwele na mboto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">nawazihola ng'handa zimemile vinhu vilivinji vinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">na mideho na migunda ja mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">na migunda ja mizeituni na migodi jiwele na mafuza menji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">Nawalya na kiguta na kudedemka ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">ahyo nawasangalala kwa chiwalo cha kunoga kwa hegwe kwinji.<verse eid="NEH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26" />Ila hawawele wa kukundigwa kwa hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">Nawakubelenhuka, nawagaleka malajizo ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">na kuwakopola waloli wawele nawawakanya, leka wakuhiluchile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">Nawakuliga ng'hatu.<verse eid="NEH 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27" />Ahyo, nakuwawika mmoko mwa wang'honyo wa hewo, wawele nawawagaza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">Lowawele kuli magazo nawakulilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">nagwe kulawa kilanga nakuhulika chililo cha hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">Na kwa isungu lya hegwe, nakuwalajiza wanhu leka wawalohole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">wawele nawawalohola kulawa mmoko mwa wang'honyo wa hewo.<verse eid="NEH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28" />“Lowawele welejehe nawadita gehile kahi hali hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">nagwe nakuwaleka wawichigwe mmoko mwa wang'honyo wa hewo, wawele nawawalongoza kwa lupichi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">Lowakulilile kahi, kulawa kilanga nakuhulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">kwa isungu lya hegwe, nakuwalohola chila mhela.<verse eid="NEH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29" />Nakuwakanya leka wahiluchile kuli malajizo ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">ila nawali wajuvi hawajihulichize mizilo ja hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">Nawagabelenhuka malajizo ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">gawele wone munhu kogawinza malajizo ago, kochikala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">Kwa ujuvi nawagaleka malajizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">nawali na nhumbula zigagadale, nawalema kuhulichiza.<verse eid="NEH 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30" />“Kwa miyaka minji nakuwemilila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">Kwa nzila ya muhe wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">nakuwakanya kwa kukolela waloli wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">ila hawawahulichize, ahyo nakuwawika mmoko mwa wanhu wa isi zinji.<verse eid="NEH 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31" />Ila kwa isungu lya hegwe likulu, huwalechile wadumigwe ne kuwasemwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:31">kwa vila hegwe ndo Nguluwi uwele na kunoga na isungu.<verse eid="NEH 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32" />“Lelo, gwa Nguluwi wa hetwe, Nguluwi mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">uwele na mong'ho na ulingudumbiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">kwangibatilila ilagano lya hegwe kwa igano lya kwimilila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">Magazo gawele nagatufika hetwe na wandewa wa hetwe na vilongozi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">na watambika wa hetwe na waloli wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">na wasekulu wa hetwe na wanhu wa hegwe weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">kulawa mhela wa wandewa wa Ashulu mbaka lehano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">uleche kugona kota ndo mado.<verse eid="NEH 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33" />Nawali na hachi ya kutuditila ahyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:33">kwa vila hegwe nawali wa kukundigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:33">ila hetwe natwali tudita gehile.<verse eid="NEH 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34" />Wandewa wa hetwe na wakulu wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">watambika wa hetwe na wasekulu wa hetwe, hawawinzile malajizo ga hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">Nawajibeza mizilo ja hegwe na makanyo ga hegwe.<verse eid="NEH 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35" />Hanga nawali kuli undewa wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">wosangalala kwa chiwalo cha kunoga kwa hegwe kukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">kuli isi ng'hulu na iwele na mboto youwapele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">hawakukolele mijito ne kuzileka nzila za hewo zihile.<verse eid="NEH 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36" />“Ila ulole, hetwe twa wapogozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:36">wapogozi kuli isi youwapele wasekulu wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:36">leka walye mafunza gake na vinhu viyage vinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:36">kulawa kuli isi ayo.<verse eid="NEH 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37" />Kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">mbena nyinji za isi zangulutaga kwa wandewa uwawichile leka watulongoze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">Wangulongoza ng'huli za hetwe na migongolo ja hetwe kota vyowalingugana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">natwe twa kuli magazo makulu.<verse eid="NEH 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wangikundiza kugawinza malajizo ga Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38" />“Kwa chiwalo cha aga geng'ha, twanguwika ilagano na kugandika aga geng'ha. Vilongozi wa hetwe na Walawi na watambika wa hetwe, wanguwika muhuli.”<verse eid="NEH 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1" />Wanhu wawele nawawika muhuli kuli kalatasi ayo nawali ndo Nehemiya, mwana wa Hakaliya, yawele nayali ndo chilongozi wa mkowa, hamwe na Sedekiya <verse eid="NEH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2" />na watambika, wawele ndo Selaya na Asaliya na Yelemiya <verse eid="NEH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3" />na Pashuli na Amaliya na Malikiya <verse eid="NEH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4" />na Hatushi na Shebaniya na Maluki <verse eid="NEH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5" />na Halimu na Melemoti na Obadiya <verse eid="NEH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6" />na Danyeli na Ginetoni na Baluku <verse eid="NEH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7" />na Meshulamu na Abiya na Miyamini <verse eid="NEH 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8" />na Maasiya na Biligayi na Shemaya. Awa nawali watambika. <verse eid="NEH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9" />Kahi, Walawi wawele nawawika muhuli nawali ndo Yeshuwa, mwana wa Asaniya na Kadimieli na Binuyi kulawa kuli lulelo lwa Henadadi. <verse eid="NEH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10" />Wang'holozawo wawele nawo kahi nawawika muhuli kuli ayo kalatasi nawali ndo Shebaniya na Hodiya na Kelita na Pelaya na Hanani <verse eid="NEH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11" />na Mika na Lehobu na Hashabiya <verse eid="NEH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12" />na Sakuli na Shelebiya na Shebaniya <verse eid="NEH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13" />na Hodiya na Bani na Beninu.<verse eid="NEH 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14" />Vilongozi wawele nawo nawawika muhuli kuli ayo kalatasi nawali ndo Paloshi na Pahati-moabu na Elamu na Satu na Bani <verse eid="NEH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15" />na Buni na Asigadi na Bebayi <verse eid="NEH 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16" />na Adoniya na Bigwayi na Adini <verse eid="NEH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17" />na Ateli na Hesekiya na Asuli <verse eid="NEH 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18" />na Hodiya na Hashumu na Besayi <verse eid="NEH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19" />na Halifu na Anatoti na Nebayi <verse eid="NEH 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20" />na Magipiashi na Meshulamu na Hesili <verse eid="NEH 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21" />na Meshesabeli na Sadoki na Yaduwa <verse eid="NEH 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22" />na Pelatiya na Hanani na Anaya <verse eid="NEH 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23" />na Hosheya na Hananiya na Hashubu <verse eid="NEH 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24" />na Haloheshi na Piliha na Shobeki <verse eid="NEH 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25" />na Lehumu na Hashabuna na Maaseya <verse eid="NEH 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26" />na Ahiya na Hanani na Anani <verse eid="NEH 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27" />na Maluki na Halimu na Baana.<verse eid="NEH 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wangikundiza kuliwinza ilagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28" />Wanhu wanji weng'ha, wawele ndo watambika na Walawi na wamizi wa lwizi na walingwimba na vitumagwa wa ng'handa ya Nguluwi na wala weng'ha wawele nawebagula na wanhu wa isi za habehi kwa chiwalo cha malajizo ga Nguluwi, hamwe na wache wa hewo na wasongolo wa hewo na wahinza wa hewo, wana wawele nawali na miyaka ja kuhega kuvizela, <verse eid="NEH 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29" />awa weng'ha wangilumba na wang'holozawo na vilongozi wa hewo kilaha na kudita ilagano kwa kuwinza malajizo ga Nguluwi gawele nagalavigwa kwa kukolela Musa chitumagwa wa Nguluwi na kibatilila malajizo na mizilo jeng'ha ja Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe. Kahi nawelaha kota wone wobena chilaho cha hewo magazo gawafiche. <verse eid="NEH 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30" />Twangulagana kota hatuweza kuwaheseza wahinza wa hetwe kwa wanhu walingutuzunguluta ne kuwakundiza wasongolo wa hetwe kuwahesa wahinza wa hewo. <verse eid="NEH 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31" />Wone wanhu wa isi za habehi wokuya kuguza vinhu vya hewo kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela, hatugula vinhu vya hewo kuli zuwa alyo ne zuwa linji lyoneche lila liwele ndo lyelile. Chila mwaka wa saba hatulima migunda na wanhu weng'ha tulinguwadai towalechela.<verse eid="NEH 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32" />“Mala imwe kuli chila mwaka, chila yumwe wa hetwe kolavya chasi chido cha sendi kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja ng'handa ya Nguluwi wa hetwe. <verse eid="NEH 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33" />Kwa sendi azo, togula mibumunda jelile na nhambiko za nyhule za hihi hela na nhambiko za kulakazwa za hihi hela na nhambiko za Zuwa lya Kwesela na nhambiko za mnvina ya kulawa kwa nyelezi na nhambiko za mnvina zinji ziwichigwe na vinhu vinji vyelile na nhambiko ya kusa gehile, leka kuwaditila uhanyisi wanhu wa Isilaeli na mijito jinji ja ng'handa ya Nguluwi.<verse eid="NEH 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34" />“Hetwe tweng'ha watambika na Walawi na wanhu weng'ha totowa simbi chila mwaka leka kuhagula lukolo luwele lochigala ngodi za kulakaza nhambiko hali honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ha Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe, kota vyoyandichigwe kuli chitabu cha malajizo. <verse eid="NEH 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35" />Twangulagana kigala kuli ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi mbena za mwaluko na mafuza ga mwaluko ga chila igodi lya mafuza. <verse eid="NEH 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36" />Kwa kuwinza kota vyoyandichigwe kuli malajizo, chila mlelwa wa mwaluko msongolo kuli ivyazi lya hetwe kohilikwa kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi wa hetwe kwa watambika walingukola mijito amo. Kahi tohilika chila walelwa wa mwaluko wa misenga ja hetwe na wa mhene za hetwe na wa ming'holo ja hetwe. <verse eid="NEH 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37" />Mzidi wa ago, tochigala kahi kuli ng'hano za ng'handa ya Nguluwi wa hetwe, kwa watambika, vilyo vya mwaluko kulawa kuli migunda ja hetwe na nhambiko za hetwe za nyhule na mafuza ga migodi ja hetwe jeng'ha na divai ya hetwe inyale na mafuta. Natwe tochigala honhu hamwe ha kumi ha mbena za hetwe kwa Walawi, kwa vila Walawi ndo walingukungajiza honhu hamwe ha kumi ha vinhu kuli miji jeng'ha jotulingukola mijito. <verse eid="NEH 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38" />Mtambika yalingulawa kuli lulelo lwa Aluni, kowa hamwe na Walawi howowa wobochela honhu hamwe ha kumi ha vinhu avyo. Walawi wohilika kuli ng'hano ya ng'handa ya Nguluwi wa hetwe, honhu hamwe ha kumi ha vinhu vyeng'ha viwele navilavigwa. <verse eid="NEH 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39" />Wanhu wa Isilaeli na Walawi wohilika nhambiko za nyhule na divai inyale na mafuta ga mzeituni kuli vihengo vya ng'hano, honhu hawele vinhu vya honhu helile vyanguwichigwa na hali honhu hawele watambika walingukola mijito na honhu hawele wamizi wangukola mijito na honhu hawele walingwimba wangukola mijito. Hatuleka kuilolela ng'handa ya Nguluwi wa hetwe.”<verse eid="NEH 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11" />
  <para style="s">Vilongozi wa wanhu wawele nawekala kuli muji wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1" />Lelo, vilongozi wa wanhu nawekala mujini Yelusalemu. Wanhu wasigale nawatowa simbi leka kuhagula ivyazi limwe hali kumi leka likale mujini Yelusalemu, muji welile. Lila ivyazi tisa lisigale likale kuli miji ja hewo. <verse eid="NEH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2" />Wanhu nawawatogola wala weng'ha wawele nawakunda kikala mujini Yelusalemu.<verse eid="NEH 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3" />Wanhu wamwenga wa Isilaeli na watambika na Walawi na wakola mijito wa kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi na walelwa wa wakola mijito wa Solomoni nawekala kuli honhu ha hewo, kuli miji ja Yuda, ila vilongozi wa mikowa nawekala mujini Yelusalemu na ivyazi lya hewo. <verse eid="NEH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4" />Wanhu wanji kulawa Yuda na Benjamini nawekala kuli muji wa Yelusalemu. Yumwe wa hewo kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Yuda nayali Ataya, mwana wa Usiya, mwana wa Sekaliya, mwana wa Amaliya, mwana wa Shefatiya, mwana wa Mahalaleli, yawele nayali ndo mlelwa wa Pelesi. <verse eid="NEH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5" />Yunji nayali Maaseya, mwana wa Baluku, mwana wa Kolihose, mwana wa Hasaya, mwana wa Adaya, mwana wa Yoyalibu, mwana wa Sekaliya, Mshilo. <verse eid="NEH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6" />Walelwa wa Pelesi wawele nawekala mujini Yelusalemu, nawali walume wazidahe kitowa ngondo miya zine na makumi sita na wanane (468).<verse eid="NEH 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7" />Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Benjamini, wanhu wawele nawekala mujini Yelusalemu, nawali Salu, mwana wa Meshulamu, mwana wa Yoedi, mwana wa Pedaya, mwana wa Kolaya, mwana wa Maaseya, mwana wa Itieli, mwana wa Yeshaya. <verse eid="NEH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8" />Wanji nawali Gabayi na Salayi, wang'holoze Salu. Hisabu ya hewo weng'ha nayali wanhu miya tisa na makumi meli na wanane (928). <verse eid="NEH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9" />Yoeli, mwana wa Sikili, nayali ndo chilongozi wa hewo, naye Yuda, mwana wa Hasenuwa, nayali chilongozi wa keli kuli muji kulawa heye.<verse eid="NEH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10" />Kulawa kwa watambika wawele nawekala mujini Yelusalemu nawali Yedaya, mwana wa Yoyalibu na Yakini <verse eid="NEH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11" />na Selaya, mwana wa Hilikiya, mwana wa Meshulamu, mwana wa Sadoki, mwana wa Melayoti, mwana wa Ahitubu, yawele nayali chilongozi wa ng'handa ya Nguluwi, <verse eid="NEH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12" />hamwe na wayawo wawele nawali wokola mijito kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi, hisabu ya hewo nayali wanhu miya nane na makumi meli na weli (822). Hamwe na hewo nayali kahi Adaya, mwana wa Yelohamu, mwana wa Pelaliya, mwana wa Amusi, mwana wa Sekaliya, mwana wa Pashuli, mwana wa Malikiya <verse eid="NEH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13" />na wayawo wawele nawali vilongozi wa ivyazi. Hisabu ya hewo nayali wanhu miya mbili na makumi gane na weli (242). Kahi nakwali na Amashisayi, mwana wa Asaleli, mwana wa Ahisayi, mwana wa Meshilemoti, mwana wa Imeli, <verse eid="NEH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14" />hamwe na wayawo wazidahe kitowa ngondo. Hisabu ya hewo nayali wanhu miya imwe na makumi meli na wanane (128). Chilongozi wa hewo mkulu nayali Sabudieli, mwana wa Hagedolimu.<verse eid="NEH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15" />Kulawa kwa Walawi wawele nawekala mujini Yelusalemu nawali Shemaya, mwana wa Hashubu, mwana wa Asilikamu, mwana wa Hashabiya, mwana wa Buni. <verse eid="NEH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16" />Shabetayi na Yosabadi wawele nawali ndo vilongozi hali ng'holo za Walawi, nawali wololela mijito ja kunze mwa ng'handa ya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NEH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17" />Mataniya, mwana wa Mika, mwana wa Sabudi, mwana wa Asafu, yawele nayali chilongozi kuli mhela wa kulanda na wa kutogola, Bakibukiya, nayali yomtanza. Hamwe na hewo nayali Abuda, mwana wa Shamuwa, mwana wa Galali, mwana wa Yedutuni. <verse eid="NEH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18" />Hisabu ya Walawi weng'ha wawele nawekala mujini Yelusalemu, muji welile, nayali miya mbili na makumi nane na wane (284).<verse eid="NEH 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19" />Wamizi wa lwizi wawele nawekala mujini Yelusalemu, nawali Akubu na Talimoni hamwe na wayawo wawele nawali wokwamila lwizi. Hisabu ya hewo nayali wanhu miya imwe na makumi saba na weli (172). <verse eid="NEH 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20" />Waisilaeli wasigale, hamwe na watambika na Walawi, nawali kuli miji ja Yuda, chila yumwe kuli uhalizi wa heye. <verse eid="NEH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21" />Vitumagwa wa ng'handa ya Nguluwi, nawali wochikala kuli chidunda cha Ofeli. Siha na Gishipa nawali vilongozi wa hewo.<verse eid="NEH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22" />Chilongozi mkulu wa Walawi ako mujini Yelusalemu, nayali Usi, mwana wa Bani, mwana wa Hashabiya, mwana wa Mataniya, mwana wa Mika, wa lukolo wa Asafu, wawele nawali walingwimba, wawele nawakola mijito kwa chiwalo cha ng'handa ya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NEH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23" />Walingwimba nawali hasi ha ilajizo lya mndewa, kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja chila zuwa. <verse eid="NEH 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24" />Petahiya, mwana wa Meshesabeli, wa lukolo wa Sela, mlelwa wa Yuda, nayali yomtanza mndewa kuwala mbuli zeng'ha zilinguwala wanhu wa Yuda.<verse eid="NEH 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu walingikala kuli miji na vijiji viyage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25" />Wanhu wenji nawekala kuli miji jiwele habehi na migunda ja hewo. Wala wawele nawalawa kuli nhanzi ya Yuda nawekala Kiliati-aliba na Diboni na Yekabuseeli na kuli vijiji viwele habehi na miji ajo. <verse eid="NEH 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26" />Wanji kahi nawekala kuli miji ja Yeshuwa na Molada na Beti-peleti <verse eid="NEH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27" />na Hasali-shuali na Beeli-sheba na vijiji vyake. <verse eid="NEH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28" />Wanji nawekala kuli miji ja Sikilagi na Mekona na vijiji vyake. <verse eid="NEH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29" />Wanji nawekala kuli miji ja Eni-limoni na Sola na Yalimuti <verse eid="NEH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30" />na Sanowa na Adulamu hamwe na vijiji vya miji ajo na kuli Lakishi na migunda jake na kuli Aseka hamwe na vijiji vyake. Ahyo nawali wochikala kwaluchila Beeli-sheba mbaka kuli Ibindi lya Hinomu.<verse eid="NEH 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31" />Walelwa wa Benjamini nawekala kuli miji ja Geba na Mikimashi na Aiya na Beteli na vijiji vyake. <verse eid="NEH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32" />Wanji nawekala kuli miji ja Anatoti na Nobu na Ananiya <verse eid="NEH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33" />na Hasoli na Lama na Gitaimu <verse eid="NEH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34" />na Hadidi na Seboimu na Nebalati <verse eid="NEH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35" />na Lodi na Ono na Ge-halashimu, iwele nalyali ndo ibindi lya Wawanzi. <verse eid="NEH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36" />Wanhu kulawa kuli vilundo vimwenga vya Walawi wa Yuda nawalajizwa wekale ako Benjamini.<verse eid="NEH 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12" />
  <para style="s">Matagwa ga watambika na Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1" />Watambika wenji na Walawi nawahiluka kulawa kuli isi ya chijenzi wawele hamwe na Selubabeli, mwana wa Shealitieli na Yeshuwa, mtambika mkulu. Watambika awo nawali ndo Selaya na Yelemiya na Esila <verse eid="NEH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2" />na Amaliya na Maluki na Hatushi <verse eid="NEH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3" />Shekaniya na Lehumu na Melemoti <verse eid="NEH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4" />na Ido na Ginetoni na Abiya <verse eid="NEH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5" />na Miyamini na Maadiya na Biliga <verse eid="NEH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6" />na Shemaya na Yoyalibu na Yedaya <verse eid="NEH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7" />na Salu na Amoki na Hilikiya na Yedaya. Awo weng'ha nawali ndo vilongozi wa watambika kuli mhela wa Yeshuwa.<verse eid="NEH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8" />Walawi nawali ndo Yeshuwa na Binuyi na Kadimieli na Shelebiya na Yuda na Mataniya, yawele nayali ndo chilongozi wa nzimbo za kulonga malumbo yotanzigwa na wang'holoze. <verse eid="NEH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9" />Nawo Bakibukiya na Uni nawali kuli chilundo cha walingwimba chiwele nachali chimile kumwando kwa hewo.<verse eid="NEH 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10" />Yeshuwa nayali ndo mhaza wa Yoyakimu na Yoyakimu nayali ndo mhaza wa Eliashibu na Eliashibu nayali ndo mhaza wa Yoyada. <verse eid="NEH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11" />Yoyada nayali ndo mhaza wa Yonatani na Yonatani nayali ndo mhaza wa Yaduwa.<verse eid="NEH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakulu wa ng'holo za watambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12" />Yoyakimu loyawele mtambika mkulu, watambika walinguwinza nawali ndo vilongozi kuli ng'holo za hewo. Kuli lukolo lwa Selaya, nayali Melaya na kuli lukolo lwa Yelemiya, nayali Hananiya, <verse eid="NEH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13" />kuli lukolo lwa Esila, nayali Meshulamu, kuli lukolo lwa Amaliya, nayali Yehohanani, <verse eid="NEH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14" />kuli lukolo lwa Maluki, nayali Yonatani, kuli lukolo lwa Shebaniya, nayali Yusufu, <verse eid="NEH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15" />kuli lukolo lwa Halimu, nayali Adina, kuli lukolo lwa Melemoti, nayali Helikayi, <verse eid="NEH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16" />kuli lukolo lwa Ido, nayali Sekaliya, kuli lukolo lwa Ginetoni, nayali Meshulamu, <verse eid="NEH 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17" />kuli lukolo lwa Abiya, nayali Sikili, kuli lukolo lwa Miniamini na Moadiya, nayali Pilitayi, <verse eid="NEH 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18" />kuli lukolo lwa Biliga, nayali Shamuwa, kuli lukolo lwa Shemaya, nayali Yehonatani, <verse eid="NEH 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19" />kuli lukolo lwa Yoyalibu, nayali Matenayi, kuli lukolo lwa Yedaya, nayali Usi, <verse eid="NEH 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20" />kuli lukolo lwa Salu, nayali Kalayi, kuli lukolo lwa Amoki, nayali Ebeli, <verse eid="NEH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21" />kuli lukolo lwa Hilikiya, nayali Hashabiya, kuli lukolo lwa Yedaya, nayali Netaneli.<verse eid="NEH 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22" />Kuli mazuwa ga watambika wakulu wawele ndo Eliashibu na Yoyada na Yohanani na Yaduwa, wakulu wa ivyazi lya Walawi na wakulu wa ivyazi lya watambika nawandichigwa kuli mhela wa ulongozi wa Daliyo, wa Pelisiya. <verse eid="NEH 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23" />Wakulu wa ivyazi lya lukolo lwa Lawi mbaka kuli mhela wa Yohanani, mzukulu wa Eliashibu, nawandichigwa kuli chitabu cha kukumbuchila.<verse eid="NEH 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24" />Vilongozi wa Walawi nawali Hashabiya na Shelebiya na Yeshuwa, mwana wa Kadimieli na wayawo, nawali kuli vilundo vili. Vilundo avyo navyali vimile vichilola kuno vitogola na kulonga malumbo, kota ilajizo lya mndewa Daudi, munhu wa Nguluwi, vyolilingulonga. <verse eid="NEH 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25" />Wamizi wawele nawali wokwamila lwizi lwa ng'hano, nawali Mataniya na Bakibukiya na Obadiya na Meshulamu na Talimoni na Akubu. <verse eid="NEH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26" />Awo nawakola mijito kuli mazuwa ga Yoyakimu, mwana wa Yeshuwa, mwana wa Yosadaki na kuli mazuwa ga chilongozi Nehemiya na kuli mazuwa ga Esila, mtambika na yalingwandika.<verse eid="NEH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukanzi lwa Yelusalemu lwanguwichigwa chiuyeng'ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27" />Hamba mhela wa kuluwika chiuyeng'ha lukanzi lwa Yelusalemu, Walawi nawapaligwa kuli chila honhu howawele wochikala leka woye Yelusalemu kuidita mnvina kwa usangalalo hamwe na kulonga malumbo na nzimbo, kuno wotumiya matoazi na ving'weleng'wele na igombogombo. <verse eid="NEH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28" />Walingwimba kahi nawekungajiza kulawa kuli honhu halinguzunguluta Yelusalemu na vijiji vya Wanetofati <verse eid="NEH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29" />na Beti-giligali na honhu hamwenga ha Geba na Asimaweti, kwa vila walingwimba nawali wezenjele vijiji hafungo ha Yelusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30" />Mhela watambika na Walawi lowasindile kiyeliza, nawaweliza wanhu na lwizi na lukanzi.<verse eid="NEH 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31" />Heni Nehemiya, nandiwalajiza vilongozi wa Yuda wakwine mchanya mwa lukanzi. Nandiwalajiza kahi walingwimba kuli vilundo vili leka vimbe nzimbo za kulonga malumbo kwa Nguluwi. Chilundo chimwe nachiluta ubanzi wa kudilo wa lukanzi mbaka kuli Lwizi lwa Mboto. <verse eid="NEH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32" />Hamba nawawinzigwa na Hoshaya na nusu ya vilongozi wa Yuda. <verse eid="NEH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33" />Hamba nawawinzigwa na Asaliya na Esila na Meshulamu <verse eid="NEH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34" />na Yuda na Benjamini na Shemaya na Yelemiya, <verse eid="NEH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35" />weng'ha awo ndo watambika wawele nawali nawapemba mhalamhanda. Hamba nayali Sekaliya, mwana wa Yonatani, mwana wa Shemaya, mwana wa Mataniya, mwana wa Mikaya, mwana wa Sakuli, mwana wa Asafu, <verse eid="NEH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36" />hamwe na wayage, wawele ndo Shemaya na Asaleli na Milalayi na Gilalayi na Maayi na Netaneli na Yuda na Hanani, wawele nawali na vinhu vya muzichi, kota vyoilajizwe na Daudi, munhu wa Nguluwi. Esila, yalingwandika, nakawalongola wanhu awo. <verse eid="NEH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37" />Kuli Lwizi lwa Nzasa nawakwina vikwinilo kulutila kuli muji wa Daudi, nawakola kuli ng'handa ya Daudi na kulutila kumbele kuli lukanzi mbaka kuli Lwizi lwa Mazi kuli ubanzi wa kolilawilaga isanya mwa muji.<verse eid="NEH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38" />Chilundo cha keli cha walingwimba nachiluta kuli ubanzi wa kumoso kuno chikwimba nzimbo za kulonga malumbo. Nandiwawinza mchanya mwa lukanzi hamwe na nusu ya wanhu kwa kukolela kuli Ilingo lya Itanulu mbaka kuli Lukanzi Lugazi <verse eid="NEH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39" />na mchanya mwa Lwizi lwa Efulaimu na Lwizi lwa Eshana na Lwizi lwa Somba na Ilingo lya Hananeli na Ilingo lya Miya Imwe na mchanya mwa Lwizi lwa Ming'holo. Lowafichile kuli Lwizi lwa Wamizi, nawema.<verse eid="NEH 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40" />Hamba vila vilundo vyeng'ha vili vya walingwimba, viwele navyali vikwimba nzimbo za kulonga malumbo, naviluta kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi chila chilundo kuli honhu hake. Nani kahi nandita hihyo, hamwe na nusu ya vilongozi <verse eid="NEH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41" />na watambika, wawele ndo Eliyakimu na Maaseya na Miniamini na Mikaya na Elioenayi na Sekaliya na Hananiya, wawele nawali na mhalamhanda za hewo. <verse eid="NEH 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42" />Awo nawawinzigwa na Maaseya na Shemaya na Eleasali na Usi na Yehohanani na Malikiya na Elamu na Eseli. Vilundo avi vya walingwimba, navimba wolongozwa na Yesilahiya.<verse eid="NEH 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43" />Zuwa alyo, wanhu nawalavya nhambiko nyinji kuno wotowa luchenze kwa vila Nguluwi nakawadita wawe na usangalalo ukulu. Wadala na wana nawasangalala kahi. Lizi lya kutowa luchenze kulawa ako Yelusalemu, nalihulikwa mbaka kutali ng'hatu.<verse eid="NEH 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mijito ja kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44" />Mhela awo wanhu nawahaguligwa leka wawe walolezi wa vihengo vya ng'hano kwa chiwalo cha ndolendole na mbena za mwaluko na honhu hamwe ha kumi ha vinhu. Wala wawele na migunda jilinguuzunguluta muji nawaganigwa kigala honhu hamwe ha kumi ha mbena kuli ng'hano kota malajizo vyogalingulonga, kwa chiwalo cha watambika na Walawi. Ahyo wanhu wa Yuda nawasangalala kwa chiwalo cha watambika na Walawi, <verse eid="NEH 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45" />kwa vila watambika na Walawi nawamfugamila Nguluwi wa hewo na kiyeliza hamwe na walingwimba na wamizi wa lwizi nawadita hihyo du, kwa kuwinza malajizo ga Daudi na Solomoni, mwanage. <verse eid="NEH 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46" />Kulawa mhela wa mndewa Daudi na Asafu, nakwali na vilongozi wa walingwimba na kahi nakwali na nzimbo za lutogo na za kulonga malumbo kwa Nguluwi. <verse eid="NEH 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47" />Ahyo, kuli mazuwa ga Selubabeli na ga Nehemiya, Waisilaeli nawalavya honhu ha nhambiko ha chila zuwa kwa chiwalo cha walingwimba na wamizi wa lwizi. Waisilaeli nawalavya ndolendole kwa chiwalo cha Walawi na Walawi nawo nawabagula honhu hamwenga ha nhambiko ayo kwa chiwalo cha walelwa wa Aluni.<verse eid="NEH 12:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13" />
  <para style="s">Kibagula na wanhu wanji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1" />Kuli zuwa alyo lya mnvina, chitabu cha Musa nachisomigwa kwa lizi likulu na wanhu weng'ha nawahulika. Kuli honhu hamwenga ha chitabu acho nahandichigwa kota Waamoni na Wamoabu hawalingukundigwa kihanza kuli nhing'hano ya wanhu wa Nguluwi, <verse eid="NEH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2" />kwa vila hawawabochele Waisilaeli kwa chilyo na mazi lowalawile Misili, ila nawamha sendi Balaamu leka yawapanjile wanhu wa Isilaeli, ila Nguluwi wa hetwe nakagalula upanjilo na kuwa utambichizo. <verse eid="NEH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3" />Wanhu wa Isilaeli lowahuliche ilajizo ali, nawawabagula wanhu weng'ha wa isi za chijenzi.<verse eid="NEH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugongomanya kahi kwa Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4" />Kung'hali zuwa lya mnvina, mtambika Eliashibu nayali yawichigwe yawe yololela vihengo vya ng'hano ya ng'handa ya Nguluwi wa hetwe. Heye na Tobiya nawali munhu na mng'holoze, <verse eid="NEH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5" />naye Eliashibu nayali yampele Tobiya chihengo chikulu chiwele aho hamwande nachali chiwichilwa nhambiko za nyhule na ubani na vinhu vya ng'handa ya Nguluwi, hamwe honhu hamwe ha kumi ha nyhule na divai inyale na mafuta, viwele Waisilaeli nawalajizwa kulavya kwa chiwalo cha Walawi na walingwimba na wamizi wa lwizi, hamwe na ndolendole kwa chiwalo cha watambika. <verse eid="NEH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6" />Mhela mbuli azi zeng'ha loziwele zikoleka, siwele Yelusalemu, kwa vila kuli mwaka wa makumi gadatu na mbili (32) wa ulongozi wa Alitashasta, mndewa wa Babuloni, nandali nyiluche kwa mndewa. Hamba nandimlanda kuhiluka, naye nakang'hundiza kuhiluka. <verse eid="NEH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7" />Lonyiluche Yelusalemu nandiizela mbuli ya wihe iwele nakaidita Eliashibu kwa kumha Tobiya chihengo kuli lugagala lwa ng'handa ya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NEH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8" />Nanzudila ng'hatu na kuvitoza kunze vinhu vyeng'ha vya Tobiya. <verse eid="NEH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9" />Nandiwalonjela wachihelize chihengo, hamba nandivihilusa vinhu vya ng'handa ya Nguluwi, hamwe na nhambiko za nyhule na ubani.<verse eid="NEH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10" />Nandivizela kahi kota Walawi hawapegwe honhu hamwe ha kumi hawele nawali woganigwa kupegwa, nawo Walawi weng'ha na walingwimba wawele nawali wokola mijito, nawali wahiluche kuli migunda ja hewo. <verse eid="NEH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11" />Ahyo, nandiwang'hanuchila vilongozi na kuwauza, “Lekachoni ng'handa ya Nguluwi naibezigwa?” Hamba nandiwachema na kuwakungajiza hamwe Walawi na walingwimba na kuwahilusa hali honhu hawo ha mijito. <verse eid="NEH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12" />Hamba wanhu weng'ha wa Yuda nawaluka kahi kigala honhu hamwe ha kumi ha nyhule na divai inyale na mafuta kuli ng'hano. <verse eid="NEH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13" />Nandimuwika mtambika Shelemiya na yalingwandika Sadoki na Pedaya, Mlawi, leka wawe wololela ng'hano. Hanani, mwana Sakuli, mwana Mataniya nayali yowatanza. Awo weng'ha nawali wa kukundigwa na mijito ja hewo najali ndo kuwagawila wang'holozawo vinhu vyowalinguganigwa kupegwa chila zuwa.<verse eid="NEH 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14" />Ahyo nandanda ndilonga kota gwa Nguluwi wa heni, ung'humbuchile kwa ali, uleche kusa chila chonditile kwa igano lya kwimilila na kwa chiwalo cha ng'handa ya hegwe na kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja hegwe.<verse eid="NEH 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15" />Kuli mazuwa ago nandiwona wanhu wa Yuda wokama zabibu kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela na kigala nyhule na divai na zabibu na tini na mhomolo ziyage kwa midogowi. Vinhu avi vyeng'ha nawali wovihilika Yelusalemu kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela. Ahyo, nandiwakanya leka waleche kuguza vinhu kuli zuwa alyo. <verse eid="NEH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16" />Wanhu wanji kulawa muji wa Tilo wawele nawali wochikala Yelusalemu, nawegala somba na vinhu viyage kuli muji wa Yelusalemu na kuwaguzila wanhu wa Yuda kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela. <verse eid="NEH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17" />Nandiwang'hanuchila vilongozi wa wanhu wa Yuda na kuwalonjela, “Ndo wihe wachi awu womlinguudita kwa kulibeza Zuwa lya Kwesela? <verse eid="NEH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18" />Ndaze, wasekulu wa hemwe hawaditile wihe kota awu na kwambuza Nguluwi wa hetwe kutigalila kubagama aku hamwe na muji awu? Lelo mwangulutilila kigala kuzudila kwa heye kwa wanhu wa Isilaeli kwa kulibeza Zuwa lya Kwesela.”<verse eid="NEH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19" />Mhela wa kuzinga kwa isanya louwele habehi, nandajiza lwizi ja muji wa Yelusalemu jihindigwe na jileche kuchumuligwa mbaka Zuwa lya Kwesela holimala. Nandiwawika wanhu wa heni wamwenga kuli lwizi leka chinhu choneche chileche kwinjizwa mgati mwa muji kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela. <verse eid="NEH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20" />Mala imwe ama mbili walingugula na kuguza vinhu, nawawasa hanze ha muji wa Yelusalemu mhela wa nechilo. <verse eid="NEH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21" />Nandiwakanya na kuwalonjela, “Lekachoni mwanguwasa habehi na lukanzi? Wone modita kota hino kahi, ndowagaza.” Kulawa zuwa lila hawoyile kahi kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela. <verse eid="NEH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22" />Hamba nandiwalajiza Walawi kiyeliza na kuluta kwamila lwizi leka kulilolela Zuwa lya Kwesela liwe lyelile. Nandanda kahi ndilonga kota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 13:22">gwa Nguluwi wa heni, ung'humbuchile kwa isungu kwa chiwalo cha gonditile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 13:22">undajile igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 13:22">kwa kiwhana na kunoga kwa hegwe kukulu.<verse eid="NEH 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23" />Mzidi wa ago, nandiwona Wayahudi wawele nawawahesa wadala kulawa Ashidodi na Amoni na Moabu. <verse eid="NEH 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24" />Nusu ya wana wa hewo nawali wolonga Chiashidodi ama ndonga ya wanhu wanji, ila hawawezile kulonga Chiyuda. <verse eid="NEH 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25" />Nandiwang'hanuchila na kuwapanjila. Nandiwatowa walume wamwenga na kutupula mnvili za hewo. Nandiwadita welahe kwa itagwa lya Nguluwi kota wawalemeze wahinza wa hewo kuhesigwa na wasongolo wa isi ya chijenzi ne wasongolo wa hewo waleche kuwahesa wahinza wa isi ya chijenzi. <verse eid="NEH 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26" />Nandiwalonjela, “Ndaze, Solomoni haditile gehile kwa chiwalo cha wadala wa kota ahyo? Heye nayali mndewa mkulu kusinda wandewa wa wanhu wa isi zinji. Nguluwi nakamgana na kumdita kuwa mndewa wa wanhu weng'ha wa Isilaeli, ila wadala wa isi zinji nawamwambuza yadite gehile. <verse eid="NEH 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27" />Ndaze, tuwawinze hemwe kwa kudita gehile aga makulu ga kuleka kumhulichiza Nguluwi wa hetwe kwa kuhesa wadala wa chijenzi?”<verse eid="NEH 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28" />Yumwe wa wana wa Yoyada, mwana wa mtambika mkulu Eliashibu, nayali yamhesile mhinza wa Sanibalati, Mholoni. Lelo, kwa chiwalo acho, nandimuwinga hali heni. <verse eid="NEH 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29" />Gwa Nguluwi, ukumbuchile ndaze wanhu awo vyowauditile utambika na ilagano lya chiutambika na lya Walawi viwe vikokomoche.<verse eid="NEH 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30" />Ahyo, nandiweliza wanhu kwa chiwalo cha chinhu choneche chiwele ndo cha chijenzi. Nambika goya malajizo kwa chiwalo cha watambika na Walawi kuwala mijito ja chila yumwe wa hewo. <verse eid="NEH 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31" />Nandali ndilolela na kutawiza kahi kota ndolendole za ngodi zangulavigwa kuli honhu ha kulavila nhambiko kuli mhela ulinguganigwa. Nandali ndilolela kahi kota mafuza ga mwaluko nagagaligwa kwa mhela uwichigwe. Nasinda kwa kulonga kota gwa Nguluwi, ung'humbuchile na unditile ganojile.<verse eid="NEH 13:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13" />
</usx>